Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.15,0:01:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,How fastidious you've become，Wormtail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,As I recall，you once called the nearest gutter pipe home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could it be that the task of nursing me has become wearisome for you？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no。No，no，my Lord Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only meant…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…perhaps if we were to do it without the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！The boy is everything！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It cannot be done without him。And it will be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly as I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I will not disappoint you，my Lord。- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,First，gather our old comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send them a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nagini tells me the old Muggle caretaker…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is standing just outside the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step aside，Wormtail，so I can give our guest a proper greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione。Bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When did you get here？- Just now。You？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wake up！Wake up，Ronald！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly，get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Ron！Your mother says breakfast's ready！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron，where are we actually going？- Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Dad。Where are we going？- Haven't the foggiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep up！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Arthur！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's about time，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Amos。Some of us had a bit of a sleepy start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Amos Diggory，everyone。Works with me at the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this strapping young lad must be Cedric，am I right？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merlin's beard！You must be Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:05:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，sir。- Great，great pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you too，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，it's just over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shall we？- Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't want to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Nearly there now。Get yourself into a good position.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are they all standing around that manky old boot？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That isn't just any manky old boot。- It's a Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to go！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's a Portkey？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ready！After three。One，two… - Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…three！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let go，kids！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？！- Let go！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll bet that cleared your sinuses，eh？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Total shambles，as per usual。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，look at that！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，kids，welcome to the Quidditch World Cup！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay together！Keep up，girls！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Keep up，girls！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Parting of the ways，I think，old chap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- See you at the match。- See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cedric。- Ced，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you later，Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Excellent，excellent。- Ginny，look！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All to the bath。- Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Girls，choose a bunk and unpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，get out of the kitchen。We're all hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，get out of the kitchen，Ron！- Feet off the table！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Feet off the table！- Feet off the table！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your Quidditch World Cup programs here！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey，Dad。How far up are we？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，put it this way：
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it rains…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you'll be the first to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Father and I are in the minister's box…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…by personal invitation of Cornelius Fudge himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't boast，Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no need with these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do enjoy yourself，won't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,While you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on up。Take your seats。I told you these seats would be worth waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the lrish！There's Troy！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And Mullet！- And Moran！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ireland！Ireland！Ireland！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here come the Bulgarians！- Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:09:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,That，sis，is the best Seeker in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Krum！Krum！Krum！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Krum！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good evening！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,As Minister for Magic…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…it gives me great pleasure…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to welcome each and every one of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to the final of the 422nd Quidditch World Cup！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let the match…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…begin！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Krum！Krum！Krum！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no one like Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Krum？- Dumb Krum？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's like a bird，the way he rides the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's more than an athlete。- Dumb Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think you're in love，Ron。- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Viktor，I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Viktor，I do
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,When we're apart My heart beats only for you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like the lrish have got their pride on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！Stop it！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not the lrish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've gotta get out of here。Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out，it's the Death Eaters！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back to the Portkey，everybody，and stick together！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fred，George！Ginny is your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Keep up，you lot！- Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morsmordre！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are you？- Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been looking for you for ages！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thought we lost you，mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupefy！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my son！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron，Harry，Hermione，you all right？- We came back for Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which of you conjured it？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Crouch，you can't possi… - Do not lie！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been discovered at the scene of the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Crime？- Barty！They're just kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,What crime？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the Dark Mark，Harry。It's his mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，Voldemort？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those people tonight，in the masks，they're his too，aren't they？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- His followers？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Death Eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Follow me。- There was a man，before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,There！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of you，this way！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,A man，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything from the trolley？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything from the trolley？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything from the trolley，dears？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Packet of Drooble's…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and a Licorice Wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,On second thought，just the Drooble's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's all right，I'll get it。Don't worry。- Just the Drooble's。Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two Pumpkin Pasties，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything sweet for you，dear？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，I'm not hungry。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything from the trolley？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can the Ministry not know who conjured it？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wasn't there any security or…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Loads，according to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what worried them so much。Happened right under their noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's hurting again，isn't it？Your scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know Sirius will want to hear about this…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…what you saw at the World Cup and the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hedwig。There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear the runway！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there's something you don't see every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，now we're all settled in and sorted，I'd like to make an announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,This castle will not only be your home this year…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but home to some very special guests as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Hogwarts has been chosen…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.62,0:16:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，what is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell them to wait。Tell them to wait。Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:17:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,So Hogwarts has been chosen to host a legendary event：
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Triwizard Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- For those of you who do not know… - Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the Triwizard Tournament brings together three schools…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…for a series of magical contests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,From each school，a single student is selected to compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now let me be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,If chosen，you stand alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,And trust me when I say…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…these contests are not for the faint-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,But more of that later。For now，please join me in welcoming…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the lovely ladies of the Beauxbatons Academy of Magic…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and their headmistress，Madame Maxime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey。That's one big woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now our friends from the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please greet the proud sons of Durmstrang…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and their high master，lgor Karkaroff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's Krum！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey，it's him！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Viktor Krum！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Igor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbly-dorr，my horses have traveled a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They will need attending to。- Don't worry，Madame Maxime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our gamekeeper，Hagrid，is more than capable of seeing to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you know，Monsieur Hagrid…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…they drink only single-malt whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You idiot！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:19:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your attention，please！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eternal glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is what awaits the student who wins the Triwizard Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,But to do this，that student must survive three tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three extremely dangerous tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wicked。- Wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,For this reason，the Ministry has seen fit to impose a new rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,To explain all this…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…we have the head of the Department of lnternational Magical Cooperation…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Mr。Bartemius Crouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell。It's Mad-Eye Moody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Alastor Moody？The Auror？- Auror？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dark-wizard catcher。Half the cells in Azkaban are filled thanks to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be mad as a hatter，though，these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My dear old friend，thanks for coming。- Stupid ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that he's drinking，do you suppose？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，but I don't think it's pumpkin juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,After due consideration…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the Ministry has concluded that，for their own safety…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…no student under the age of 17…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…shall be allowed to put forth their name for the Triwizard Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This decision is final。- That's rubbish！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's rubbish！You don't know what you're doing！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Silence！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Goblet of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.68,0:22:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyone wishing to submit themselves to the tournament…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.75,0:22:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…need only write their name upon a piece of parchment…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and throw it in the flame before this hour on Thursday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.03,0:22:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not do so lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,If chosen，there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,As from this moment，the Triwizard Tournament has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alastor Moody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ex-Auror…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.84,0:23:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Ministry malcontent…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.48,0:23:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and your new Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am here because Dumbledore asked me。End of story，goodbye，the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any questions？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,When it comes to the Dark Arts…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I believe in a practical approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,But first，which of you can tell me how many Unforgivable Curses there are？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Three，sir。- And they are so named？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because they are unforgivable。The use of any one of them will…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will earn you a one-way ticket to Azkaban，correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.01,0:23:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Ministry says you're too young to see what these curses do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.91,0:24:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say different！You need to know what you're up against！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to find another place to put your chewing gum…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…besides the underside of your desk，Mr。Finnigan！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.99,0:24:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No way。The old codger can see out the back of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.69,0:24:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,And hear across classrooms！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,So which curse shall we see first？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.47,0:24:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Weasley！- Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.87,0:24:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.37,0:24:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.31,0:24:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，my dad did tell me about one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.75,0:24:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,The lmperius Curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah，your father would know all about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.89,0:24:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gave the Ministry quite a bit of grief a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps this will show you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.13,0:24:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.10,0:24:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lovely little beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.94,0:24:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Engorgio.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.31,0:25:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Imperio！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。It's completely harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,If she bites…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.19,0:25:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…she's lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.37,0:25:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get off！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talented，isn't she？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.17,0:25:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What should I have her do next？Jump out the window？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.54,0:25:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drown herself？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scores of witches and wizards have claimed…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that they only did You-Know-Who's bidding…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:25:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…under the influence of the lmperius Curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:26:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,But here's the rub：
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do we sort out the liars？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.34,0:26:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another，another.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.04,0:26:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Up，up。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.75,0:26:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Longbottom，is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.52,0:26:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor Sprout tells me you have an aptitude for herbology.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.29,0:26:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's the…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Cruciatus Curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.26,0:26:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Correct，correct。Come，come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Particularly nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,The torture curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crucio！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it！Can't you see it's bothering him？Stop it！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps you could give us the last Unforgivable Curse，Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.58,0:27:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,No？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.12,0:27:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Killing Curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.69,0:27:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only one person is known to have survived it…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and he's sitting in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant，isn't he？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.30,0:28:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Completely demented，of course，and terrifying to be in the same room with…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.50,0:28:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but he's really been there，you know？He's looked evil in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.84,0:28:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a reason those curses are unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.61,0:28:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,To perform them in a classroom… I mean，did you see Neville's face？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.65,0:28:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neville？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.28,0:28:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Son？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.09,0:28:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.69,0:28:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。We'll have a cup of tea。I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.61,0:28:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna be late！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.19,0:29:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Cedric。Put it in！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.14,0:29:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eternal glory。Be brilliant，wouldn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.81,0:29:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three years from now，when we're old enough to be chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.61,0:29:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，rather you than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.55,0:29:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.62,0:29:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，lads，we've done it。- Cooked it up just this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.23,0:29:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，yeah？- And why is that，Granger？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see this？This is an Age Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.03,0:29:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore drew it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,So？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,So a genius like Dumbledore couldn't possibly be fooled…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.81,0:30:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…by a dodge as pathetically dimwitted as an Aging Potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.98,0:30:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But that's why it's so brilliant。- Because it's so pathetically dimwitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ready，Fred？- Ready，George.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.15,0:30:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bottoms up。- Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.43,0:30:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes！- Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.19,0:30:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.83,0:30:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.90,0:30:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.70,0:30:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes！- Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.38,0:30:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You said！- You said！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.32,0:30:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，right，you want a piece of me？！- I'll tear your ears off！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.92,0:30:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now you're making me laugh。- Take this！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.59,0:30:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fight！Fight！Fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.13,0:30:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're 「old school」，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but you look older！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.80,0:31:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sit down。Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.87,0:31:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now the moment you've all been waiting for：
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.91,0:31:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,The champion selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.48,0:32:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Durmstrang champion is Viktor Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.23,0:32:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,The champion for Beauxbatons…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.80,0:32:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is Fleur Delacour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.38,0:32:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Hogwarts champion，Cedric Diggory！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.42,0:33:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent！We now have our three champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.99,0:33:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,But in the end，only one will go down in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.37,0:33:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only one will hoist this chalice of champions…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.00,0:33:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…this vessel of victory…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.21,0:33:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the Triwizard Cup！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.17,0:33:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.94,0:33:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.65,0:34:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.39,0:34:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.05,0:34:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，for goodness sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.32,0:34:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a cheat！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.06,0:34:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not even 17 yet！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.49,0:35:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's wrong，I tell you！- You French tart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.16,0:35:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Everything is a conspiracy theory with you！- Quiet！I can't think！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.29,0:35:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Everything is a conspiracy theory！- I protest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry。- I protest！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.83,0:35:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you put your name in the Goblet of Fire？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.87,0:35:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，sir。- Did you ask one of the older students…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.20,0:35:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …to do it for you？- No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're absolutely sure？- Yes。Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.04,0:35:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But of course he is lying。- The hell he is！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.48,0:35:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Goblet of Fire is an exceptionally powerful magical object.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only an exceptionally powerful Confundus Charm could have hoodwinked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.31,0:35:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magic way beyond the talents of a fourth year.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.48,0:35:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seem to have given this a fair bit of thought，Mad-Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.65,0:35:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was once my job to think as dark wizards do，Karkaroff…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.99,0:35:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …perhaps you remember。- This doesn't help，Alastor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.86,0:35:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave this to you，Barty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.53,0:35:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rules are absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.94,0:36:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Goblet of Fire constitutes a binding magical contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.21,0:36:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Potter has no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.21,0:36:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is，as of tonight…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.35,0:36:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a Triwizard champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.31,0:36:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,This can't go on，Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,First the Dark Mark。Now this？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.78,0:36:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you suggest，Minerva？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.95,0:36:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put an end to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.49,0:36:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't let Potter compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.66,0:36:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You heard Barty。The rules are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.29,0:37:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，the devil with Barty and his rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.30,0:37:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,And since when did you accommodate the Ministry？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.90,0:37:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Headmaster，l，too，find it difficult to believe this mere coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.07,0:37:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,However，if we are to truly discover the meaning of these events…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.17,0:37:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,…perhaps we should，for the time being…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.68,0:37:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Iet them unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.11,0:37:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Do nothing？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.45,0:37:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Offer him up as bait？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.09,0:37:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter is a boy，not a piece of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.82,0:37:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I agree。With Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.13,0:37:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alastor，keep an eye on Harry，will you？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.23,0:37:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can do that。- Don't let him know，though.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.97,0:37:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must be anxious enough as it is…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.60,0:37:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…knowing what lies ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.64,0:37:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then again，we all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.09,0:38:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you do it？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.36,0:38:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never mind。Doesn't matter。Might've let your best friend know，though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.16,0:38:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let you know what？- You know bloody well what.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.63,0:38:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for this to happen，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.50,0:38:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.27,0:38:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're being stupid。- Yeah，that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.94,0:38:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron Weasley，Harry Potter's stupid friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.18,0:38:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't put my name in that cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.58,0:38:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want eternal glory。I just wanna be…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.19,0:38:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I don't know what happened tonight，and I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.83,0:38:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.93,0:38:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.31,0:38:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a charismatic quartet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.89,0:39:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.36,0:39:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Rita Skeeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I write for the Daily Prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,But of course you know that，don't you？It's you we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.84,0:39:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the juicy news.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.84,0:39:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,What quirks lurk beneath those rosy cheeks？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What mysteries do the muscles mask？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.89,0:39:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does courage lie beneath those curls？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.29,0:39:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,In short，what makes a champion tick？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.83,0:39:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「 Me，Myself & l」 want to know。Not to mention my rabid readers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.30,0:39:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,So who's feeling up to sharing？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.10,0:39:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shall we start with the youngest？Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.98,0:40:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.35,0:40:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a broom cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.42,0:40:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should feel right at home，then.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.92,0:40:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I use a Quick-Quotes Quill，do you？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.86,0:40:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.80,0:40:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,So tell me，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here you sit，a mere boy of 12…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.03,0:40:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm 14。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.70,0:40:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…about to compete against three students…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.84,0:40:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…not only vastly more emotionally mature than yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.28,0:40:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but who have mastered spells that you wouldn't attempt…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.05,0:40:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in your dizziest daydreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Concerned？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.08,0:40:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。I haven't really thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.09,0:40:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just ignore the quill.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.42,0:40:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then，of course，you're no ordinary boy of 12，are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.13,0:40:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fourteen。- Your story's legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.50,0:40:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think it was the trauma of your past…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.83,0:41:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that made you so keen to enter such a dangerous tournament？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.24,0:41:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I didn't enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.17,0:41:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.04,0:41:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone loves a rebel，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scratch that last.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.28,0:41:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speaking of your parents，were they alive，how do you think they'd feel？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.62,0:41:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Proud？Or concerned…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.59,0:41:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that your attitude shows，at best，a pathological need for attention…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.59,0:41:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…at worst，a psychotic death wish？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.19,0:41:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，my eyes aren't 「glistening with the ghosts of my past.」
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.56,0:42:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，I couldn 't risk sending Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.07,0:42:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since the World Cup，the Ministry's been intercepting more and more owls…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.50,0:42:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and she 's too easily recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.91,0:42:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to talk，Harry，face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meet me in the Gryffindor common room，1：00 this Saturday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.28,0:42:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,And make sure you 're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.22,0:42:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.88,0:42:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,P.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.55,0:42:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bird bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.70,0:42:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.02,0:42:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter，age 12…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.09,0:43:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…suspect entrant in the Triwizard Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.22,0:43:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,His eyes swimming with the ghosts of his past…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.99,0:43:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and choking back tears…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.04,0:43:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius。How？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don ' t have much time，so let me get straight to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.48,0:43:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you or did you not put your name into the Goblet of Fire？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.58,0:43:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.65,0:43:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.09,0:43:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，tell me about this dream of yours。You mentioned Wormtail and Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,But who was the third man in the room？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.66,0:43:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't know。- You didn't hear a name？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.00,0:43:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.43,0:43:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort was giving him a job to do。Something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.34,0:43:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what was that？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.81,0:43:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wanted…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.61,0:43:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:44:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know why。But he was gonna use this man to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.45,0:44:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，I mean，it was only a dream，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.99,0:44:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.79,0:44:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.09,0:44:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.69,0:44:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Death Eaters at the World Cup，your name rising from that goblet…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.33,0:44:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…these are not just coincidences。Hogwarts isn't safe anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.50,0:44:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you saying？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.77,0:44:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm saying the devils are inside the walls。Igor Karkaroff？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.21,0:44:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was a Death Eater。And no one，no one stops being a Death Eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.04,0:44:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then there's Barty Crouch。Heart of stone。Sent his own son to Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.99,0:44:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think one of them put my name in the goblet？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.26,0:44:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't a clue who put your name in that goblet…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.72,0:44:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but whoever did is no friend to you。People die in this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.86,0:44:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not ready for this，Sirius。- You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.90,0:44:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Someone's coming。- Keep your friends close，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.61,0:45:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who were you talking to？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.11,0:45:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？Who says I was talking to anyone？- I heard voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.45,0:45:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you're imagining things。Wouldn't be the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.98,0:45:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're probably just practicing for your next interview，I expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.25,0:45:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.85,0:45:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Amazing！- Neville。You're doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.12,0:45:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.39,0:45:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Magical Water Plants of the Highland Lochs」？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.56,0:45:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moody gave it to me。That day we had tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.23,0:45:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's already been through enough people.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.13,0:46:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you just go and talk to him yourself？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.70,0:46:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ron，this is your problem，not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.21,0:46:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want me to say again？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.48,0:46:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.75,0:46:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ronald would like me to tell you that Seamus told him…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.48,0:46:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that Dean was told by Parvati that Hagrid's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.25,0:46:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that right？Well，you…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.86,0:46:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.03,0:46:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you sure you won't do this？- Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.77,0:46:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean was told by Parvati that…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.97,0:46:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please don't ask me to say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.58,0:46:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.54,0:46:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，you can tell Ronald… - I'm not an owl！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.16,0:46:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you bring your father's cloak，like I asked you？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.59,0:47:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I brought the cloak。Hagrid，where are we going？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.36,0:47:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now pay attention，this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.87,0:47:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's with the flower？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.37,0:47:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid，have you combed your hair？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.17,0:47:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact，I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.34,0:47:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You might like to try the same thing now and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.79,0:47:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hagrid？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.16,0:47:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,The cloak！Put the cloak on！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.60,0:47:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bonsoir，Olympe。- Oh，Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought perhaps you weren't coming。I thought perhaps…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you had forgotten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.91,0:47:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Couldn't forget you，Olympe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.51,0:47:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it you wanted to show me？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.02,0:48:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,When we spoke earlier，you sounded so…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.59,0:48:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…exhilarated.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.66,0:48:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be glad you came。Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.07,0:48:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we get closer？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.65,0:48:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dragons？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.28,0:48:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the first task？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.18,0:48:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're joking。- Come on，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.49,0:48:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are seriously misunderstood creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.62,0:48:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，crikey！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.59,0:48:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Although，I have to admit，that Horntail is a right nasty piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.90,0:48:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Poor Ron nearly fainted just seeing him，you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.24,0:48:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ron was here？- Oh，sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.44,0:48:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,His brother Charlie helped to bring him over from Romania.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't Ron tell you that？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.51,0:48:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.65,0:49:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,He didn't tell me a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.46,0:49:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You cheat，Potter。- You stink，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.06,0:49:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good luck，Potter。- Potter stinks！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.90,0:49:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cedric rules。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.64,0:49:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like the badge？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.87,0:49:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.78,0:49:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.81,0:49:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Read the badge，Potter！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.95,0:49:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I have a word？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.42,0:49:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right。- You stink，Potter！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.45,0:49:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Potter，you stink！- Harry Potter smells！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.96,0:49:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dragons。That's the first task.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.70,0:49:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They've got one for each of us。- Come on，Ced！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.00,0:49:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you serious？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.80,0:49:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Fleur and Krum，do they…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.00,0:49:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。- Come on，Ced，leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.44,0:50:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。- He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.08,0:50:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Read the badges，Potter！- Hey，listen。About the badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.74,0:50:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've asked them not to wear them，but… - Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.95,0:50:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not like I try to blow things up，exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.08,0:50:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,It just happens a fair bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.72,0:50:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to admit，though，fire's pretty fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.96,0:50:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a right foul git，you know that？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.96,0:50:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You think so？- I know so.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.39,0:50:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything else？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.90,0:50:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。Stay away from me。- Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.77,0:50:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There's Potter。Cheat。- Why so tense，Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.14,0:50:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,My father and I have a bet，you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.71,0:50:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think you're gonna last 10 minutes in this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.48,0:50:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,He disagrees。He thinks you won't last five.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.58,0:50:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn what your father thinks，Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.69,0:50:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's vile and cruel。And you're just pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.59,0:50:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pathetic？- Oh，no，you don't，sonny！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.36,0:50:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll teach you to curse someone when their back is turned！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.43,0:51:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You stinking，cowardly，scummy…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.44,0:51:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Professor Moody！- …back-shooting…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.34,0:51:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing？- Teaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.28,0:51:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ls that a… Is that a student？- Technically，it's a ferret.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.05,0:51:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand still！Stand still！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.97,0:51:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My father will hear about this！- ls that a threat？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.34,0:51:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Professor Moody！- ls that a threat？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.44,0:51:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.47,0:51:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could tell you stories about your father that would curl even your greasy hair！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.21,0:51:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Alastor！Alastor。- lt doesn't end here！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.08,0:51:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,We never use transfiguration as a punishment！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.05,0:51:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Surely Dumbledore told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.79,0:51:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He might've mentioned it。- Well，you will do well to remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.36,0:51:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Away！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.93,0:52:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You。Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.37,0:52:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a Foe-Glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.17,0:52:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lets me keep an eye on my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I can see the whites of their eyes，they're standing right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.31,0:52:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wouldn't even bother telling you what's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.95,0:52:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe it if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.25,0:52:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…what are you going to do about your dragon？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.36,0:53:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you know，I just thought l'd…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.13,0:53:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.34,0:53:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.74,0:53:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your pal Diggory？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.08,0:53:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,By your age，he could turn a whistle into a watch and have it sing you the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.68,0:53:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Delacour？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.35,0:53:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's as much a fairy princess as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.59,0:53:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,As for Krum，his head may be filled with sawdust…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.32,0:53:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but Karkaroff's is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.66,0:53:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll have a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.66,0:53:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you can bet that it will play to Krum's strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.97,0:53:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.70,0:53:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are your strengths？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.37,0:53:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.91,0:53:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I can fly。I mean，I'm a fair flyer。But l…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.88,0:54:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Better than fair，the way I heard it。- But I'm not allowed a broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.08,0:54:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're allowed a wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.16,0:54:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bets！Place your bets！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.79,0:54:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bets taken！Bets taken here！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.13,0:54:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step up，folks！Who fancies a flutter in today's bloodbath？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.23,0:54:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smart money's on Krum to survive！Any bets？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.27,0:54:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.10,0:54:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten-to-1 for Fleur。There you go。Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.34,0:54:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your attention，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.51,0:54:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a great day for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.55,0:54:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Each of the three tasks involves very considerable danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.95,0:54:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please keep your seats at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.82,0:54:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,This will minimize any risks you may be exposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.73,0:54:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry？Is that you？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.33,0:54:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure we all wish our champions…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.20,0:54:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How are you feeling？Okay？- … the greatest of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.57,0:54:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,The key is to concentrate。After that，you just have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.14,0:55:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Battle a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.28,0:55:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Young love.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.48,0:55:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,How…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.22,0:55:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…stirring.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.19,0:55:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,If everything goes unfortunately today…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.53,0:55:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you two may even make the front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.46,0:55:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have no business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.87,0:55:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,This tent is for champions…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.24,0:55:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.74,0:55:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter。We've got what we wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.05,0:55:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good day，champions。Gather round，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.02,0:55:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you've waited，you've wondered，and at last the moment has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.39,0:55:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,A moment only four of you can fully appreciate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.79,0:55:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here，Miss Granger？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.23,0:55:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，I'll just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.06,0:55:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barty，the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.03,0:56:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Champions，in a circle around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.43,0:56:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Delacour，over here。Mr。Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.70,0:56:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，Potter，Mr。Potter，over here。That's right。Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.81,0:56:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Miss Delacour，if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.31,0:56:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Welsh Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.62,0:56:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.93,0:56:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chinese Fireball.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.30,0:56:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Swedish Short-Snout.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.17,0:56:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Which leaves… - The Horntail.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.34,0:56:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that，boy？- Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.01,0:56:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Hungarian Horntail.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.58,0:56:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,These represent four very real dragons…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.89,0:56:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…each of which has been given a golden egg to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.12,0:56:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your objective is simple：
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.76,0:56:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Collect the egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.43,0:57:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,This you must do，for each egg contains a clue…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.60,0:57:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…without which you cannot hope to proceed to the next task.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.27,0:57:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any questions？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well。Good luck，champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.47,0:57:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Diggory，at the sound of the cannon，you may…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.92,0:57:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Diggory！Diggory！Diggory！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.33,0:57:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three of our champions have now faced their dragons…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.87,0:57:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and so each one of them will proceed to the next task.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.94,0:57:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now our fourth and final contestant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.01,0:57:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！Harry！Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.68,0:59:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your wand，Harry！Your wand！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.12,0:59:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Accio Firebolt！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.15,0:59:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah！- Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.23,0:59:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.31,1:00:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah！- Yeah！Well done，dragon！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.59,1:02:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.99,1:03:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，Harry！- Knew you wouldn't die，Harry。Lose a leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.86,1:03:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Or an arm。- Pack it in altogether？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.96,1:03:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Never！- Never！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.83,1:03:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shush！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.63,1:03:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，Harry。What's the clue？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.33,1:03:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who wants me to open it？- Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.97,1:03:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you want me to open it？- Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.68,1:03:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the bloody hell was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.22,1:03:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，everyone！Go back to your knitting.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.13,1:03:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is gonna be uncomfortable enough without all you nosy sods listening in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.33,1:03:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I reckon you have to be barking mad to put your own name in the Goblet of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.67,1:03:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Caught on，have you？Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.54,1:03:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wasn't the only one who thought you'd done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.81,1:04:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone was saying it behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.28,1:04:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant。That makes me feel loads better.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.45,1:04:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Least I warned you about the dragons。- Hagrid warned me about the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.02,1:04:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.66,1:04:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，don't you remember？I told Hermione to tell you…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.86,1:04:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that Seamus told me that Parvati told Dean that Hagrid was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.10,1:04:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seamus never actually told me anything，so it was really me all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.04,1:04:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought we'd be all right，you know…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.27,1:04:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…after you'd figured that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.64,1:04:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who… Who could possibly figure that out？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.98,1:04:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's completely mental.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.58,1:04:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.78,1:04:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suppose I was a bit distraught.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.42,1:04:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.58,1:05:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi，Harry。- Hi，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.65,1:05:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cho，Harry's looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.19,1:05:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shush.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.60,1:05:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at this！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.97,1:05:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe it！She's done it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.50,1:05:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Miss Granger，a plain but ambitious girl…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.91,1:05:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…seems to be developing a taste for famous wizards.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.84,1:05:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her latest prey，sources report…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.28,1:05:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is none other than the Bulgarian bonbon，Viktor Krum.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.21,1:05:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,No word yet on how Harry Potter's taking this latest emotional blow.「
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.52,1:05:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Parcel for you，Mr。Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.62,1:05:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Nigel.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.93,1:05:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not now，Nigel。Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.60,1:06:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.47,1:06:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told him I'd get him Harry's autograph.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.44,1:06:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，look，Mum's sent me something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.35,1:06:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mum sent me a dress.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.36,1:06:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it does match your eyes。Is there a bonnet？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.63,1:06:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nose down，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.00,1:06:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ginny，these must be for you。- I'm not wearing that，it's ghastly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.70,1:06:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you on about？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.70,1:06:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not for Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.81,1:06:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.18,1:06:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dress robes。- Dress robes？For what？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.18,1:06:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Yule Ball…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.52,1:06:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…has been a tradition of the Triwizard Tournament…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.59,1:06:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…since its inception.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:07:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,On Christmas Eve night，we and our guests…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.36,1:07:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…gather in the Great Hall…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.20,1:07:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…for a night of well-mannered frivolity.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.80,1:07:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,As representatives of the host school…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.24,1:07:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I expect each and every one of you to put your best foot forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.64,1:07:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I mean this literally，because…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the Yule Ball is，first and foremost…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.75,1:07:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.49,1:07:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Silence！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.49,1:07:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,The house of Godric Gryffindor has commanded the respect…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.66,1:07:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of the wizard world for nearly 10 centuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.47,1:07:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will not have you，in the course of a single evening，besmirching that name…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.70,1:07:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…by behaving like a babbling，bumbling band of baboons.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.64,1:07:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try saying that five times fast，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.78,1:07:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，to dance…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.45,1:07:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is to let the body breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.32,1:07:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inside every girl，a secret swan slumbers…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.82,1:08:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Ionging to burst forth and take flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.36,1:08:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something's about to burst out of Eloise Midgen，but I don't think it's a swan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.53,1:08:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inside every boy，a lordly lion prepared to prance.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.83,1:08:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。Weasley。- Yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.23,1:08:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you join me，please？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.27,1:08:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，place your right hand on my waist.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.98,1:08:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where？- My waist.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.71,1:08:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,And extend your arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.72,1:08:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Filch，if you please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.75,1:08:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，two，three.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.92,1:08:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，two，three。One，two，three.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.13,1:08:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never gonna let him forget this，are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.43,1:08:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Never。- Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.77,1:08:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody come together。Boys，on your feet！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.73,1:09:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do they have to travel in packs？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.83,1:09:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you supposed to get one on their own to ask them？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.34,1:09:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey，Harry。You've slayed dragons。If you can't get a date，who can？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.01,1:09:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I'd take the dragon right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.48,1:09:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I take after my mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.22,1:09:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Though I didn't know her very well。She left when I was about 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.32,1:09:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not the maternal sort，her.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.43,1:09:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Broke me dad's heart，though。He was a tiny little fella，my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.16,1:09:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could pick him up at the age of 6 with one hand and put him up on the dresser.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.87,1:09:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He laughed so hard at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.27,1:10:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.08,1:10:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then he died just when I started school，so…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.98,1:10:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I sort of had to make me own way，as it were.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.45,1:10:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,But enough of me。What about you？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is mad。At this rate，we'll be the only ones in our year without dates.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.25,1:10:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，us and Neville.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.15,1:10:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but，then again，he can take himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.55,1:10:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,It might interest you to know that Neville's already got someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.36,1:10:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I'm really depressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.97,1:11:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Get a move on or all the good ones will have gone.」
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.47,1:11:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who you going with，then？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.18,1:11:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oi，Angelina？- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.05,1:11:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you wanna go to the ball with me？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.68,1:11:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,To the ball？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.59,1:11:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.76,1:11:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oi，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.49,1:11:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.30,1:11:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well spotted.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.80,1:11:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come with one of us？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.37,1:11:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。It's one thing for a bloke to show up alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.44,1:11:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,For a girl，it's just sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.11,1:11:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won't be going alone，because，believe it or not，someone's asked me！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.82,1:11:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I said yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.66,1:11:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.42,1:12:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's lying，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.26,1:12:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.20,1:12:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we've just gotta grit our teeth and do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.67,1:12:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonight，when we get back to the common room，we'll both have partners。Agreed？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.74,1:12:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.66,1:12:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cho！- Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.57,1:12:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch yourself on the stairs。It's a bit icy at the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.47,1:12:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.51,1:12:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cho？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.51,1:12:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.45,1:12:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I just wondered if you…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.85,1:12:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wondered if maybe you wanted to go to the ball with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.32,1:13:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，I didn't catch that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.49,1:13:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if maybe you wanted to go to the ball with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.43,1:13:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.17,1:13:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I'm sorry，but someone's already asked me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.01,1:13:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,And…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.11,1:13:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I've said I'll go with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.01,1:13:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Yeah。Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.88,1:13:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine。No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.92,1:13:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.79,1:13:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.16,1:13:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really am…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.13,1:13:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.54,1:13:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.21,1:13:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay，Ron。It's all right。It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.58,1:14:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to you？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.71,1:14:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,He just asked Fleur Delacour out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.05,1:14:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- What did she say？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.72,1:14:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.65,1:14:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She said yes？- Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.39,1:14:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,There she was，walking by。You know how I like it when they walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.56,1:14:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I couldn't help it。It just sort of slipped out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.37,1:14:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，he sort of screamed at her。It was a bit frightening.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.01,1:14:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And what did you do then？- What else？I ran for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.78,1:14:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out for this，Harry。I don't know what got into me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.68,1:14:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi，Harry。- Hi，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.08,1:14:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I always liked looking at them from behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.49,1:14:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's never gonna forgive me，ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.69,1:14:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.77,1:15:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.71,1:15:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.98,1:15:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.45,1:15:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，bloody…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.39,1:15:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are those？What are those？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.26,1:15:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My dress robes。- Well，they're all right！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.46,1:15:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No lace。No dodgy little collar.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.56,1:15:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I expect yours are more traditional.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.67,1:15:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Traditional？！They're ancient！I look like my Great Aunt Tessie！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.07,1:15:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I smell like my Great Aunt Tessie.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.88,1:15:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Murder me，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.12,1:15:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave it alone！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.65,1:15:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Poor kid。I bet she's alone in her room，crying her eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.26,1:15:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who？- Hermione，of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.89,1:15:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Harry，why do you think she wouldn't tell us who she's coming with？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.66,1:16:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because we'd take the mickey out of her if she did.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.03,1:16:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody asked her。Would've taken her myself if she wasn't so bloody proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.11,1:16:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello，boys。- Hello，boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.67,1:16:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you look…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.08,1:16:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…dashing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.85,1:16:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you are，Potter。Are you and Miss Patil ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.18,1:16:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ready，professor？- To dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.18,1:16:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's traditional that the three champions… Well，in this case，four.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.39,1:16:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…are the first to dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.79,1:16:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Surely I told you that。- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.99,1:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，now you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.23,1:16:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,As for you，Mr。Weasley，you may proceed into the Great Hall with Miss Patil.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.70,1:16:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，there you are。- Come on，then.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.27,1:16:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come along this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.64,1:16:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.31,1:16:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。- Now，I need you all to line up…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.48,1:16:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in the procession，please。Oh，you are very late.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.05,1:16:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way。This way。Come along.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.16,1:16:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,She looks beautiful！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.56,1:17:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，she does.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.54,1:17:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that Hermione Granger？With Viktor Krum？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.75,1:17:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.02,1:18:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.33,1:18:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，take my waist.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.20,1:18:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.20,1:19:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.64,1:19:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move your body like a hairy troll
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.67,1:19:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Learning to rock and roll
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.54,1:19:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spin around like a crazy elf
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.65,1:19:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dancing by himself
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.18,1:19:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boogie down like a unicorn
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.69,1:19:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,No stopping till the break of dawn
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.29,1:19:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put your hands up in the air
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.33,1:19:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like an ogre who just don 't care
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.80,1:19:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you dance like a Hippogriff？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.80,1:19:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ruddy pumpkinhead，isn't he？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.17,1:20:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think it was the books that had him going to the library.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.51,1:20:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I have your arm？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.21,1:20:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Arm。Leg。I'm yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.84,1:20:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hot，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.11,1:20:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Viktor's gone to go and get drinks。Would you care to join us？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.61,1:20:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，we'd not care to join you and Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.99,1:20:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's got your wand in a knot？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.62,1:20:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a Durmstrang。You're fraternizing with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.49,1:20:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,The enemy？Who was it wanting his autograph？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.76,1:20:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，the whole point of the tournament…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.37,1:21:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is international magical cooperation…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.47,1:21:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.70,1:21:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he's got a bit more than friendship on his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.85,1:21:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you going to ask me to dance or not？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.35,1:21:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.03,1:21:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's using you。- How dare you？！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.63,1:21:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Besides，I can take care of myself。- I doubt it。He's way too old.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.00,1:21:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？！What？That's what you think？- Yeah，that's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.84,1:21:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know the solution then，don't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.14,1:21:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go on。- Next time there's a ball…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.31,1:21:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…pluck up the courage and ask me before somebody else does！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.62,1:21:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,And not as a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.82,1:21:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that's… I mean，that's just completely off the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.19,1:21:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.99,1:21:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where have you been？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.46,1:21:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never mind！Off to bed，both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.76,1:22:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They get scary when they get older。- Ron，you spoiled everything！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.97,1:22:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this about？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.11,1:22:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，don 't let
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.91,1:22:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,This magic die
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.02,1:22:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,The answer's there
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.11,1:23:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.52,1:23:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，the time is close now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.12,1:23:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，at last！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.29,1:23:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step aside，Wormtail，so I can give our guest a proper greeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.24,1:23:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.08,1:23:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just got in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.45,1:24:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.96,1:24:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，you told me you'd figured the egg out weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.40,1:24:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The task is two days from now。- Really？I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.14,1:24:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suppose Viktor's already figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.11,1:24:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wouldn't know。We don't actually talk about the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.14,1:24:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，we don't really talk at all。Viktor's more of a physical being.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.48,1:24:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just mean he's not particularly loquacious.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.15,1:24:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mostly，he watches me study.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.19,1:24:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a bit annoying，actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.66,1:24:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are trying to figure this egg out，aren't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.20,1:24:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.30,1:24:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,It just means these tasks are designed to test you…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.47,1:24:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in the most brutal way。They're almost cruel.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.77,1:25:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.74,1:25:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I'm scared for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.58,1:25:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got by the dragons mostly on nerve.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.78,1:25:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not sure it's going to be enough this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.45,1:25:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Potter！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.89,1:25:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Potter！- Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.10,1:25:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,How… How are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.83,1:25:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spectacular.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.77,1:25:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I realize I never really thanked you properly for tipping me off about those dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.77,1:25:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget it。I'm sure you would've done the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.41,1:25:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.08,1:25:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know the Prefects' bathroom on the fifth floor？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.49,1:25:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not a bad place for a bath.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.46,1:25:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just take your egg…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.09,1:25:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and mull things over in the hot water.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.03,1:26:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must be out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.41,1:26:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm definitely out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.25,1:26:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd try putting it in the water if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.69,1:26:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Myrtle！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.75,1:26:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.22,1:26:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.76,1:27:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was circling a blocked drain the other day…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.60,1:27:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and could swear I saw a bit of Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.21,1:27:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not being a bad boy again，are you，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.71,1:27:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Polyjuice Potion？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.24,1:27:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kicked the habit。Myrtle，did you say，「Try putting it in the water」？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.09,1:27:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.62,1:27:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other boy…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.69,1:27:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the handsome one…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.06,1:27:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.70,1:27:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，go on。Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.48,1:27:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come seek us Where our voices sound
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.65,1:28:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,We cannot sing Above the ground
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.49,1:28:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,An hour long you'll have to look
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.59,1:28:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,To recover what we took
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.44,1:28:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Myrtle…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.34,1:28:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…there aren't merpeople in the Black Lake，are there？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.68,1:28:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.22,1:28:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It took Cedric ages to riddle it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.09,1:28:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost all the bubbles were gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.51,1:28:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，tell me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.18,1:29:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Come seek us where our voices sound.」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.18,1:29:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Black Lake，that's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.72,1:29:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,「An hour long you'll have to look.」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.42,1:29:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Again，obvious。Though，admittedly，potentially problematic.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.26,1:29:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Potentially problematic」？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.30,1:29:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,When's the last time you held your breath underwater for an hour，Hermione？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.10,1:29:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Harry，we can do this。The three of us can figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.60,1:29:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hate to break up the skull session.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.27,1:29:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor McGonagall wants you in her office.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.51,1:29:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not you，Potter，just Weasley and Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.08,1:29:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，sir，the second task is only hours away，and…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.91,1:29:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly。Presumably Potter is well prepared by now…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.68,1:29:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and could do with a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.72,1:29:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go。Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.20,1:29:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Longbottom！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.17,1:29:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you help Potter put his books back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.84,1:30:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，if you're interested in plants…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.21,1:30:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you'd be better off with Goshawk's Guide to Herbology.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.42,1:30:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know there's a wizard in Nepal who's growing gravity-resistant trees？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.92,1:30:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neville，no offense，but I really don't care…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.26,1:30:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…about plants.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.33,1:30:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，if there's…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.20,1:30:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a Tibetan turnip that will allow me to breathe underwater for an hour…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.17,1:30:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…then great。But otherwise…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.84,1:30:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know about a turnip。But you could always use gillyweed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.81,1:30:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Any bets？Any bets？- Come on，place your bets！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.88,1:30:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step up，mates！Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.51,1:30:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Three lads。- One lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.12,1:30:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Four go down。- But do four come up？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.45,1:30:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be so mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.59,1:30:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Any bets？- Fleur's 10-1.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.59,1:30:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're sure about this，Neville？- Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.76,1:30:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- For an hour？- Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.86,1:30:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most likely？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.53,1:30:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there is some debate among herbologists…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.90,1:31:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…as to the effects of fresh water versus salt water…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.53,1:31:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're telling me this now？You must be joking！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.37,1:31:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just wanted to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.51,1:31:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that makes you a right sight better than Ron and Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.78,1:31:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are they anyway？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.71,1:31:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You seem a little tense，Harry。- Do l？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.75,1:31:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to the second task.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.16,1:31:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last night，something was stolen from each of our champions.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.03,1:31:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,A treasure of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.56,1:31:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,These four treasures，one for each champion…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.37,1:31:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…now lie on the bottom of the Black Lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.23,1:31:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,In order to win…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.97,1:31:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…each champion need only find their treasure and return to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.97,1:31:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Simple enough，except for this：- Put that in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.78,1:31:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,They will have but one hour to do so，and one hour only.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.58,1:31:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,After that，they'll be on their own。No magic will save them.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.98,1:31:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You may begin at the sound of the cannon.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.78,1:32:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's the matter with him？- I don ' t know，I can ' t see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.05,1:32:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。I've killed Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.89,1:32:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.96,1:32:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.17,1:33:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Beauxbatons champion，Miss Delacour…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.48,1:33:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…has unfortunately been forced to retire…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.65,1:34:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…so she will take no further part in this task.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.53,1:35:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But she' s my friend too！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.96,1:35:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only one！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.05,1:36:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get down below.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.89,1:36:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Krum！Krum！Krum！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.29,1:37:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.14,1:37:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ascendio！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.45,1:37:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.45,1:38:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.12,1:38:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's all right。Barty！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.72,1:38:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go get him another towel。- I want all the judges over here now！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.76,1:38:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saved her，even though she wasn't yours to save.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.90,1:38:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,My little sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.00,1:38:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.37,1:38:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you！You helped.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.74,1:38:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，yeah，a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.98,1:38:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry！- Hermione！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.32,1:38:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？You must be freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.22,1:38:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Personally，I think you behaved admirably.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.32,1:38:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I finished last，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.19,1:38:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Next to last。Fleur never got past the Grindylows.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.50,1:38:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Krum！Krum！Krum！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.90,1:38:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on！Come on！- Attention！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.14,1:38:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.21,1:39:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,The winner is Mr。Diggory…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.51,1:39:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,…who showed innate command of the Bubble-Head Charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.18,1:39:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,However，seeing as Mr。Potter would have finished first…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.02,1:39:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…had it not been for his determination to rescue not only Mr。Weasley…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.16,1:39:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but the others as well，we've agreed to award him…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.60,1:39:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…second place…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.77,1:39:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Second place！- Well done！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.43,1:39:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…for outstanding moral fiber！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.34,1:39:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.38,1:39:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right on。- All that moral fiber，eh？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.34,1:39:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's great。- Moral fiber？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.15,1:39:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey。Even when you go wrong，it turns out right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.68,1:39:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，well done，Moral Fiber。- Congratulations，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.52,1:39:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A fine achievement。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.35,1:39:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.06,1:39:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- See you at Hagrid's，Harry。- I'm sorry we haven't spoken.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.46,1:39:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,After all，your story is one I've heard so many times.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.46,1:39:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quite remarkable，really。Tragic，of course…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.10,1:39:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to lose one's family.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.10,1:40:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never whole again，are we？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.51,1:40:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still，life goes on…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.28,1:40:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and here we stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.82,1:40:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure your parents would be very proud of you today，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.72,1:40:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bartemius！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.35,1:40:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not trying to lure Potter into one of the Ministry's summer internships，are we？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.66,1:40:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The last boy who went into the Department of Mysteries never came out！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.34,1:40:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they say I'm mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.52,1:40:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I remember… I remember when I first met you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.42,1:40:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Biggest bunch of misfits I ever set eyes on.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.96,1:40:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Suppose you remind me of meself a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.70,1:40:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And here we all are，four years later。- We're still a bunch of misfits.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.90,1:41:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，maybe，but we've all got each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.40,1:41:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Harry，of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.14,1:41:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Soon to be the youngest Triwizard champion there's ever been！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.71,1:41:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hooray！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.18,1:41:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hogwarts，Hogwarts Hoggy Warty Hogwarts
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.85,1:41:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teach us something，please
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.46,1:41:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Crouch？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.04,1:41:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,A man has died here，Fudge。And he won't be the last。You must take action.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.81,1:41:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will not.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.54,1:41:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,In times like these，the wizard world looks to its leaders for strength，Dumbledore！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.78,1:41:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then for once show them some！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.28,1:41:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Triwizard Tournament will not be canceled。I will not be seen as a coward！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.55,1:41:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,A true leader does what is right，no matter what others think.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.92,1:41:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What did you say to me？- Excuse me，gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.89,1:42:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It may interest you to know this conversation is no longer private.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.90,1:42:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.64,1:42:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，how good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.77,1:42:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can come back later，professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.47,1:42:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not necessary，Harry。The minister and I are done。I'll be back in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.98,1:42:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Minister，after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.08,1:42:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you are。Your hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.25,1:42:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Harry，do feel free to indulge in a little Licorice Snap in my absence.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.09,1:42:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I have to warn you，they're a wee bit sharp.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.75,1:44:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.52,1:44:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Professor。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.96,1:44:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Igor Karkaroff，you have been brought from Azkaban at your own request…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.90,1:44:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to present evidence to this council.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.00,1:44:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should your testimony prove consequential…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.87,1:44:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…council may be prepared to order your immediate release.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.11,1:44:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until such time，you remain in the eyes of the Ministry a convicted Death Eater.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.88,1:44:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you accept these terms？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.15,1:44:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I do，sir。- And what do you wish to present？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.19,1:44:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have names，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.19,1:44:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was Rosier，Evan Rosier.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.46,1:44:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Rosier is dead。- He took a piece of me with him…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.17,1:44:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …though，didn't he？- I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.47,1:44:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- lf that is all the witness has to offer… - No，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.27,1:45:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was Rookwood！He was a spy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.74,1:45:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Augustus Rookwood？Of the Department of Mysteries？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.28,1:45:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.64,1:45:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,He passed information to You-Know-Who from inside the Ministry itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.55,1:45:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well。Council will deliberate.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.99,1:45:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the meantime，you will return to Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.12,1:45:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Wait！Wait，please！Please，I have more！What about Snape？Severus Snape？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.03,1:45:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,As the council is aware，I've given evidence on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.16,1:45:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus Snape was indeed a Death Eater and，prior to Lord Voldemort's downfall…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.30,1:45:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …turned spy for us at great personal risk。- It's a lie！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.47,1:45:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Today he's no more a Death Eater than I am。- Snape remains faithful to the Dark Lord！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.07,1:45:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Silence！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.98,1:45:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless the witness possesses any genuine name of consequence…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.58,1:45:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…this session is now concluded.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.88,1:45:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.89,1:45:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've heard about one more.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.52,1:45:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that？- The name.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.26,1:45:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes？- I know for a fact…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.89,1:45:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…this person took part in the capture…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.09,1:45:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and，by means of the Cruciatus Curse…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.43,1:45:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…torture of the Auror Frank Longbottom and his wife！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.10,1:46:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,The name。Give me the wretched name！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.60,1:46:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barty Crouch…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.84,1:46:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.35,1:46:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold him down！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.69,1:46:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your filthy hands off me，you pathetic little men！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.03,1:46:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.03,1:46:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are no son of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.41,1:46:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Curiosity is not a sin，Harry。But you should exercise caution.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.25,1:46:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a Pensieve.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.82,1:46:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very useful if，like me，you find your mind a wee bit stretched.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.66,1:47:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,It allows me to see once more things I've already seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.66,1:47:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Harry，I have searched and searched for something…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.80,1:47:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…some small detail…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.77,1:47:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…something I might have overlooked…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.07,1:47:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…something that would explain why these terrible things have happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.07,1:47:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every time I get close to an answer，it slips away.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.01,1:47:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's maddening.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.95,1:47:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir？Mr。Crouch's son.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.49,1:47:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What exactly happened to him？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.72,1:47:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was sent to Azkaban。Destroyed Barty to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.19,1:47:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he had no choice。The evidence was overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.27,1:47:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why do you ask？- It's just that l…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.00,1:47:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had a dream about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.37,1:47:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was in the summer，before school.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.31,1:47:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the dream，I was in a house.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.52,1:48:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Voldemort was there，only he wasn 't quite human.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.45,1:48:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Wormtail was there too。And Mr。Crouch 's son.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.46,1:48:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have there been others like this dream？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.13,1:48:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always the same one.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.80,1:48:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，these dreams…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.30,1:48:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…what I see，you don ' t think it' s actually happening，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.14,1:48:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's unwise for you to linger over these dreams，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.61,1:48:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's best if you simply…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.22,1:48:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…cast them away.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.26,1:48:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a sign，Severus。You know what it means as well as l.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.94,1:48:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.31,1:49:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your hurry？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.95,1:49:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congratulations，your performance in the Black Lake was inspiring.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.89,1:49:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gillyweed，am I correct？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.93,1:49:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.39,1:49:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ingenious.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.63,1:49:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,A rather rare herb，gillyweed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.40,1:49:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not something found in your everyday garden.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.61,1:49:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nor is this.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.75,1:49:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Know what it is？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.72,1:49:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bubble juice，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.72,1:49:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Veritaserum.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.36,1:49:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three drops of this and You-Know-Who himself would spill his darkest secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.23,1:49:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,The use of it on a student is，regrettably，forbidden。However…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.06,1:49:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…should you ever steal from my personal stores again…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.27,1:50:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…my hand might just slip over your morning pumpkin juice.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.31,1:50:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I haven't stolen anything。- Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.85,1:50:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gillyweed may be innocuous，but boomslang skin，lacewing flies？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.25,1:50:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and your little friends are brewing Polyjuice Potion，and believe me…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.76,1:50:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I'm going to find out why！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.78,1:50:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah！- Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.57,1:51:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sonorus！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.34,1:51:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Earlier today，Professor Moody placed the Triwizard Cup deep within the maze.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.85,1:51:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only he knows its exact position。Now，as Mr。Diggory…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.92,1:51:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and Mr。Potter…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.59,1:51:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…are tied for first position…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.50,1:51:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…they will be the first to enter the maze，followed by Mr。Krum…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.87,1:51:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …and Miss Delacour。- Come on！Krum！Krum！Krum！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.21,1:51:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first person to touch the cup will be the winner！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.65,1:51:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've instructed the staff to patrol the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.55,1:51:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should，at any point，a contestant wish to withdraw from the task…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.65,1:51:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he or she need only send up red sparks with their wands.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.49,1:52:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Contestants！Gather around。Quickly！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.53,1:52:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the maze，you'll find no dragons or creatures of the deep.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.04,1:52:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Instead，you'll face something even more challenging.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.57,1:52:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，people change in the maze.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.78,1:52:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，find the cup if you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.64,1:52:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,But be very wary，you could just lose yourselves along the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.88,1:52:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Champions，prepare yourselves！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.93,1:52:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.80,1:52:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My boy。- See you later，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.10,1:52:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the count of three。One…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.48,1:56:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fleur？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.38,1:56:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fleur.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.39,1:56:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Periculum！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.89,1:57:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.93,1:57:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.30,1:57:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.14,1:57:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，don't！Stop！He's bewitched，Cedric！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.51,1:57:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get off me！- He's bewitched！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.19,1:57:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.78,1:57:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.85,1:58:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.89,1:58:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.79,1:58:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.33,1:58:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reducto！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.92,1:58:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks。- No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.82,1:58:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，for a moment there，I thought you were gonna let it get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.69,1:58:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,For a moment，so did l.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.29,1:58:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some game，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.50,1:58:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some game.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.34,1:58:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.11,1:59:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，take it。You saved me，take it！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.32,1:59:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Together。One，two… - Two…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.49,1:59:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …three！- …three！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.17,1:59:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You okay？- Yeah。You？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.18,1:59:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are we？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.22,1:59:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.49,1:59:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.86,1:59:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry，the cup is a Portkey。- I've been here before，in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.20,1:59:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cedric！We have to get back to the cup。Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.77,1:59:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.98,2:00:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry！What is it？- Get back to the cup！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.52,2:00:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who are you？What do you want？- Kill the spare.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.02,2:00:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Avada Kedavra！- No！Cedric！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.10,2:00:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it！Now！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.92,2:00:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bone of the father…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.59,2:00:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…unwillingly given.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.36,2:01:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flesh of the servant…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.43,2:01:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…willingly sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.71,2:01:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,And blood of the enemy…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.25,2:01:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…forcibly taken.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.79,2:01:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord shall rise…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.53,2:01:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…again.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.86,2:02:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,My wand，Wormtail.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.81,2:02:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold out your arm.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.94,2:02:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.71,2:02:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，master.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.52,2:02:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other arm，Wormtail.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.62,2:03:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome，my friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.93,2:03:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thirteen years it's been，and yet…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.33,2:03:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…here you stand before me as though it were only yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.77,2:03:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I confess myself…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.17,2:03:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.41,2:03:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not one of you tried to find me.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.68,2:04:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crabbe！Macnair！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.95,2:04:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goyle！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.79,2:04:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not even you…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.29,2:04:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Lucius.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.06,2:04:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Lord，had I detected any sign，a whisper of your whereabouts…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.07,2:04:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,There were signs，my slippery friend。And more than whispers.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.24,2:04:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I assure you，my Lord，I have never renounced the old ways.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.11,2:04:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The face I have been obliged to present each day since your absence…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.75,2:04:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that is my true mask.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.75,2:04:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I returned.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.79,2:04:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of fear，not loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.83,2:04:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still，you have proved yourself useful these past few months，Wormtail.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.81,2:05:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，master.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.74,2:05:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.58,2:05:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Such a handsome boy。- Don't touch him！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.42,2:05:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.09,2:05:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd almost forgotten you were here.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.06,2:05:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Standing on the bones of my father。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.63,2:05:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd introduce you…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.16,2:05:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but word has it you're almost as famous as me these days.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.14,2:05:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The boy who lived.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.97,2:05:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,How lies have fed your legend，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.04,2:05:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shall I reveal what really happened that night 13 years ago？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.21,2:05:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shall I divulge how I truly lost my powers？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.12,2:05:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，shall l？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.05,2:05:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was love.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.56,2:05:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，when dear，sweet Lily Potter gave her life for her only son…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.23,2:05:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…she provided the ultimate protection.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.23,2:06:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could not touch him.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.27,2:06:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was old magic.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.57,2:06:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something I should have foreseen.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.00,2:06:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But no matter，no matter.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.97,2:06:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.94,2:06:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can touch you…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.05,2:06:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.92,2:06:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.60,2:06:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Astonishing what a few drops of your blood will do，eh，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.44,2:06:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pick up your wand，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.77,2:06:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said，pick it up！Get up！Get up！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.58,2:06:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been taught how to duel，I presume，yes？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.08,2:06:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,First，we bow to each other.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.68,2:06:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，now，Harry。The niceties must be observed.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.22,2:06:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore wouldn't want you to forget your manners，would he？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.62,2:06:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said，bow.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.82,2:07:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's better。And now… - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.56,2:07:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crucio！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.90,2:07:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crucio！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.70,2:07:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attaboy，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.80,2:07:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your parents would be proud.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.24,2:07:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Especially your filthy Muggle mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.81,2:07:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliar…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.42,2:07:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill you，Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.98,2:07:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.19,2:07:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,After tonight，no one will ever again question my powers.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.39,2:07:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,After tonight，if they speak of you…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.13,2:07:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…they'll speak only of how you…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.10,2:07:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…begged for death.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.10,2:07:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,And l，being a merciful Lord…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.41,2:07:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…obliged.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.34,2:07:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get up！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.85,2:07:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you turn your back on me，Harry Potter！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.98,2:08:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to look at me when I kill you！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.42,2:08:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to see the light leave your eyes！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.57,2:08:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.34,2:08:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Expelliarmus！- Avada Kedavra！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.26,2:08:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do nothing！He's mine to finish！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.50,2:08:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's mine！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.27,2:09:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，when the connection is broken，you must get to the Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.44,2:09:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can linger for a moment to give you some time…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.67,2:09:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but only a moment。Do you understand？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.64,2:09:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，take my body back，will you？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.85,2:09:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take my body back to my father.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.42,2:09:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.22,2:09:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sweetheart，you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.02,2:09:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let go！Let go！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.40,2:09:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Accio！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.47,2:10:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.22,2:10:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,He did it！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.06,2:10:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.49,2:10:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.20,2:10:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！No，don't！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.73,2:10:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,For God's sake，Dumbledore，what's happened？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.90,2:10:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's back。He's back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.64,2:10:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort's back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.84,2:10:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cedric，he asked me to bring his body back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.41,2:10:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I couldn't leave him，not there.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.91,2:10:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，Harry。It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.88,2:10:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's home。You both are.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.35,2:10:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep everybody in their seats。A boy has just been killed.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.06,2:10:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The body must be moved，Dumbledore。There are too many people.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.99,2:10:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me through.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.86,2:10:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me through！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.30,2:11:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me through！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.73,2:11:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my son！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.44,2:11:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my boy！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.71,2:11:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my boy！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.25,2:11:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。Get up。Easy，easy！- No.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.98,2:11:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not where you want to be right now。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.62,2:11:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.89,2:11:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right，I got you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.46,2:11:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got you。Come on。Easy，now.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.80,2:11:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.71,2:11:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.98,2:12:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right，Potter？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.25,2:12:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does it hurt？That？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.35,2:12:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not so much now.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.09,2:12:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'd better take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.33,2:12:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,The cup was a Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.03,2:12:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone had bewitched it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.14,2:12:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was it like？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.57,2:12:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was he like？- Who？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.41,2:12:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.48,2:12:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was it like to stand in his presence？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.85,2:12:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.49,2:13:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was like I'd fallen into one of my dreams…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.39,2:13:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…into one of my nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.11,2:13:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Were there others？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.85,2:13:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the graveyard，were there others？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.05,2:13:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.16,2:13:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I said anything about a graveyard，professor.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.53,2:13:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Marvelous creatures，dragons，aren't they？」
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.21,2:14:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you think that miserable oaf would've led you into the woods…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:00.45,2:14:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if I hadn't suggested it？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.88,2:14:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think Cedric Diggory would've told you to open the egg underwater…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.75,2:14:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if I hadn't told him first myself？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.86,2:14:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you think Neville Longbottom，the witless wonder…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.69,2:14:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…could've provided you with gillyweed if I hadn't given him the book…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.06,2:14:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that led him straight to it？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.04,2:14:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was you from the beginning。You put my name in the Goblet of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.61,2:14:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You bewitched Krum，but you… - 「But… But…」
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.42,2:14:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You won because I made it so，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.22,2:14:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ended up in that graveyard tonight because it was meant to be so.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.89,2:14:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now the deed is done.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.86,2:14:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,The blood that runs through these veins runs within the Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.71,2:15:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Imagine how he will reward me when he learns…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.14,2:15:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that I have once and for all…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.25,2:15:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…silenced the great Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.75,2:15:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.72,2:15:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.46,2:15:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it，take it.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.93,2:15:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you know who I am？- Albus Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.57,2:15:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you Alastor Moody？Are you？- No.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.44,2:15:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is he in this room？Is he in this room？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.58,2:15:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，away from there！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.10,2:16:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You all right，Alastor？- I'm sorry，Albus.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.40,2:16:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's Moody。But then who's…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.27,2:16:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.54,2:16:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we know who's been stealing from your stores，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.01,2:16:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll get you up in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.38,2:16:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.45,2:16:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barty Crouch Junior.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.89,2:17:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll show you mine if you show me yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.19,2:17:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your arm，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.77,2:17:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what this means，don't you？
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.90,2:17:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's back.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.44,2:17:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lord Voldemort has returned.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.51,2:17:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，sir。I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.04,2:17:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send an owl to Azkaban。I think they'll find they're missing a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.05,2:17:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll be welcomed back like a hero。- Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.12,2:17:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Personally，I've never had much time for heroes.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.88,2:17:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today，we acknowledge…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.25,2:17:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a really terrible loss.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.12,2:18:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cedric Diggory was，as you all know…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.05,2:18:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…exceptionally hard-working…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.29,2:18:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…infinitely fair-minded…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:08.23,2:18:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and，most importantly…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.83,2:18:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a fierce，fierce friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.53,2:18:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I think，therefore，you have the right to know exactly how he died.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:23.94,2:18:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.31,2:18:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Cedric Diggory was murdered…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.31,2:18:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…by Lord Voldemort！
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.22,2:18:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Ministry of Magic does not wish me to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.42,2:18:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,But not to do so，I think，would be an insult to his memory.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.29,2:18:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，the pain…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.13,2:18:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…we all feel at this dreadful loss reminds me…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.97,2:18:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and reminds us…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.47,2:18:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that while we may come from different places and speak in different tongues…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.34,2:18:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,…our hearts beat as one.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.28,2:19:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,In light of recent events…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:00.65,2:19:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the bonds of friendship we've made this year will be more important than ever.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.45,2:19:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember that，and Cedric Diggory will not have died in vain.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.22,2:19:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You remember that…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.96,2:19:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and we'll celebrate a boy who was…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:18.53,2:19:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…kind and honest…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.50,2:19:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and brave and true，right to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.33,2:19:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never liked these curtains.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.96,2:19:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Set them on fire in my fourth year.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.97,2:19:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,By accident，of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.48,2:20:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I put you in terrible danger this year，Harry。I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.25,2:20:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.15,2:20:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…when I was in the graveyard，there was a moment…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.96,2:20:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…when Voldemort's wand and mine sort of connected.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.93,2:20:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Priori Incantatem.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.40,2:20:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saw your parents that night，didn't you？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.70,2:20:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,They reappeared.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.01,2:20:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,No spell can reawaken the dead，Harry。I trust you know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.35,2:20:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dark and difficult times lie ahead.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.42,2:20:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Soon we must all face the choice between what is right and what is easy.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.63,2:20:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,But remember this：
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.46,2:20:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have friends here.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.40,2:21:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.85,2:21:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.99,2:21:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.59,2:21:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Write to me。Promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.90,2:21:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.54,2:21:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Au revoir，Ron.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.42,2:22:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think we'll ever just have a quiet year at Hogwarts？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.12,2:22:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- No.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.42,2:22:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I didn't think so。Oh，well。What's life without a few dragons？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.19,2:22:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's going to change now，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.34,2:22:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.54,2:22:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Promise you'll write this summer。Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.01,2:22:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won't。You know I won't.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:00.85,2:23:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry will，won't you？- Yeah。Every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:13.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与火焰杯》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.15,0:01:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么变得这么挑剔了，虫尾巴？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没记错 你不久前还以阴沟为家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你伺候我觉得烦了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，不，伏地魔主人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…或许我们没有那个男孩也行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，那男孩就是一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没他成不了事 肯定会成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就和我说的一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会让你失望的，主人 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，把我们的旧部召来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们发信号
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜吉妮告诉我那麻瓜老看门人…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…正站在门外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边站，虫尾巴 让我好好问候一下我们的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏…我做了个噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么时候到的？ - 刚才，你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒！醒醒，罗纳得！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你，穿好衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，拜托！ 你妈妈说早饭已经准备好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩，咱们这是要去哪？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，老爸，我们这是去哪？ - 我也是云里雾里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来得可真“准时”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，阿莫斯 有些人今天睡过了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙们，这是阿莫斯·迪戈里 他和我在魔法部共事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位从天而降的年轻人肯定是 塞德里克了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！你一定是哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:05:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的，先生 - 非常，非常荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始吧？ - 好唉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不想迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，该出发了，找好位置
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么都围着那个破靴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那可不是个普通的靴子 - 它是“港口钥”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该出发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是“港口钥”？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了么？一，二… - 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…三！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们，放手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？！ - 放手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定七荤八素了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和以往一样，一团糟 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们，欢迎来到魁地奇世界杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走散了，跟上，姑娘们！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跟上，姑娘们！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,老伙计，我们该分道扬镳了 比赛时见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比赛时见 - 到时见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塞德里克 - 塞德里克，来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见，塞德里克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎到我们的新家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 棒极了，棒极了 - 金妮，看！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要去厕所的速度 - 看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们，挑张床打开行李吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，快从厨房里出来，我们都饿着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对，罗恩，从厨房里出来！ - 把脚从桌上放下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把脚从桌上放下来！ - 把脚从桌上放下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里领取魁地奇世界杯时间表！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸，有没有搞错 我们还要朝上走多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我们这样比喻一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果下雨…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你们肯定最先知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸和我坐部长包厢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是康奈利·福吉亲自邀请我们来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吹了，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这些人不值
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,会玩得开心的，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁自己还有口气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来，坐这边 早告诉你们这些位子值得等的了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是爱尔兰队，那是特洛伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有米兰！ - 还有姆勒！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔兰！爱尔兰！爱尔兰！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在出场的是保加利亚队！ - 是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:09:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最出色的找球手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为魔法部部长…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我很荣幸的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…欢迎各位…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…来观看第422届魁地奇世界杯的决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能比上克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克鲁姆？ - 冷面克鲁姆？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就像一只鸟一样在空中飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不仅仅是个运动员 - 冷面克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个艺术家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想你爱上他了，罗恩 - 胡说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,威克多尔，我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,威克多尔，我确实爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你离开的时候，我的心只为你跳动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是爱尔兰人在庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,停，停下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是爱尔兰人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶快离开这！ 就是现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑啊，食死徒来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,到“港口钥”那里 别走散了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷德，乔治，金妮由你们来照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家快跟上！ - 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！ 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪？ - 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找你好久了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为把你给丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我儿子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩，哈利，赫敏，你们没事吧？ - 我们是回来找哈利的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们中的谁施的魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克劳奇，你不会… - 不要撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在犯罪现场被发现
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 犯罪？ - 巴蒂，他们只是孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么罪？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，这是黑魔标记，是“他”的标记
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道是伏地魔？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上那些戴着面具的人 是他的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的追随者？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,食死徒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 还有另外一个人，就刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都和我到这边来！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人？哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看见他的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖糖果咯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖糖果咯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，要什么糖果么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一包糖和…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一根甘草棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改主意了，只要糖就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系，我帮你给钱 - 只要糖，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个南瓜甜饼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，要吃糖么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，我不饿，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖糖果咯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法部怎么会不知道这是谁干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道没有保安？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,据老爸讲很多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事就在他们眼皮底下发生 所以他们才这么担心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的疤又疼了，是么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天狼星肯定想知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…世界杯上发生的事还有你的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:13.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小天狼星布莱克收）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德薇，去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑道畅通！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，这可不是天天都能看见的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们都坐下了 我想宣布一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座城堡今年将不仅仅是你们的家…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…也会是一些特殊客人的家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨被选中…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.62,0:16:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们等等，稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:17:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨被选中来举办一项传奇性的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,“三强争霸赛”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人可能不清楚 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…三强争霸赛 是一个由三所学校参加的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…系列魔法竞赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个学校派出一名学生参赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别注意的是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,若被选出就要靠你自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你们可别不信…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…胆小的人不宜参赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,详情我们等会再说 现在请和我一起欢迎…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…布斯巴顿魔法学院可爱的女士们…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…和她们的女校长，马克西姆夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，这女人块头真大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在欢迎来自北方的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,德姆斯特朗的骄子…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…及他们的校长，伊戈尔·卡卡洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，是他！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,威克多尔·克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿不思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊戈尔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓不利多教授，我的马长途跋涉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们也需要人照料 - 别担心，马克西姆夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的护院，海格 绝对有能力照顾它们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但海格先生，要知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…它们只喝麦芽威士忌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:19:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说几句
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,三强争霸赛的胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,将得到永恒的荣耀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为达此目标，他必须经过三项考验
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,三项非常严峻的考验
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帅啊 - 帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有鉴于此，部长决定实施一个新规则
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请巴蒂·克劳奇先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…国际魔法合作协会会长…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,…为我们解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要命，是疯眼汉穆迪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿拉斯特·穆迪，是个傲罗 - 傲罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉拿黑巫师的人 阿兹卡班监狱里一半的人都是他抓的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最近有点神志不清了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老朋友，谢谢你能来 - 这天花板真傻气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们猜他喝的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道，但肯定不是南瓜汁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过充分考虑…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…魔法部决定 为了学生的安全…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…17岁以下的学生…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一律不许参加三强争霸赛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是最终的决定 - 垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾，废话！ 你脑子是不是有病！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,火焰杯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.68,0:22:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,想报名参赛的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.75,0:22:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…必须将自己的名字写在羊皮纸上…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…于周四晚此时以前丢到火焰里去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.03,0:22:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是闹着玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果被选上就不能回头了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,三强争霸赛从此时开始
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫阿拉斯特·穆迪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,前傲罗…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.84,0:23:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…对魔法部不满的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.48,0:23:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…黑魔法防御课的新老师
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是邓不利多请我来任教的 废话到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对黑魔法的教学…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我认为实践最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先，谁能告诉我 有多少种不可饶恕咒？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三种，先生 - 为什么这么称呼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为它们不可饶恕 使用其中任何一个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会让你拿到一张去阿兹卡班的单程票 说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.01,0:23:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长说你们还太小 不适合看这些咒语的功力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.91,0:24:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么看 你们该知道自己要面对的是什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,该有所准备
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲尼根先生，你该找个…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…课桌下面以外的地方来扔口香糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.99,0:24:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？ 这老家伙背后长眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.69,0:24:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有顺风耳呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…我们应该先说哪一个？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.47,0:24:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦斯莱 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.87,0:24:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.37,0:24:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们说一个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.31,0:24:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸告诉过我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.75,0:24:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷心咒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，当然，你爸爸一定很熟悉这个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.89,0:24:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前曾经给魔法部造成不小的麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来告诉你为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.13,0:24:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.10,0:24:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小美人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.94,0:24:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.31,0:25:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷心咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心，它不会伤害你的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它咬你一口…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.19,0:25:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…可是致命的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑什么笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.37,0:25:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个天才？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.17,0:25:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来要做什么？ 把它扔到窗上？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.54,0:25:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,淹死它？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多男女巫师…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都声称自己为“那个人”做事…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:25:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是受了迷心咒的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:26:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但关键是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么判断谁在说谎？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.34,0:26:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一个
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.04,0:26:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来，快点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.75,0:26:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是伦伯特，对么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.52,0:26:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯普劳特教授说你在草药学方面有特长
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.29,0:26:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻心咒
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.26,0:26:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，没错，来，过来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨人的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻心咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！没看到他很难受吗 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰杰小姐，能否告诉我们 最后一个咒语是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.58,0:27:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.12,0:27:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,死咒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.69,0:27:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人曾经幸免一死…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他就坐在这间教室里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.30,0:28:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，也是个神经病 和他同处一室真可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.50,0:28:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道，他曾经身临其境 曾经直面邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.84,0:28:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些咒语不可饶恕是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.61,0:28:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却在教室里被演示 你们真该看看纳威的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.65,0:28:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.28,0:28:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.09,0:28:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.69,0:28:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，一起喝杯茶 我想给你看点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.61,0:28:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要迟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.19,0:29:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，塞德里克 别磨蹭！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.14,0:29:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒的荣耀，很棒不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.81,0:29:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等三年之后吧，咱们够了岁数
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.61,0:29:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，选你也别选我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.55,0:29:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.62,0:29:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们成功了 - 今天早上新出炉的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.23,0:29:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，是的 - 格兰杰，你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这个了么？ 这是年龄线
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.03,0:29:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓不利多亲自画的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以，像邓不利多那样的天才…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.81,0:30:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是不可能被增龄药这样的小把戏骗过的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.98,0:30:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这才是我们聪明的地方 - 因为他想不到我们会用这馊主意
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了么，弗雷德 - 准备好了，乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.15,0:30:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一口闷 - 一口闷
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.43,0:30:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好唉！ - 好唉！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.19,0:30:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好唉！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.83,0:30:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好唉！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.90,0:30:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.70,0:30:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好唉！ - 好唉！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.38,0:30:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你说的 - 是你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.32,0:30:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想尝尝我的厉害？！ - 看我不把你耳朵揪下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.92,0:30:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别让我笑了 - 接招！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.59,0:30:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,打！打！打！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.13,0:30:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是“老学校”，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，但你看起来更老了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.80,0:31:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请就座
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.87,0:31:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此刻，我们已等待许久
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.91,0:31:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇士选拔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.48,0:32:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,德姆斯特朗的勇士是威克多尔·克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.23,0:32:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,布斯巴顿的勇士是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.80,0:32:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…芙蓉·德拉库尔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.38,0:32:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨的勇士是塞德里克·迪戈里！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.42,0:33:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我们已经选出了三位勇士
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.99,0:33:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最终，只有一位能被载入史册
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.37,0:33:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他将举起冠军奖杯…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.00,0:33:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利的象征…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.21,0:33:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,“三强冠军杯”！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.17,0:33:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.94,0:33:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.65,0:34:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.39,0:34:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.05,0:34:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，快点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.32,0:34:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他作弊！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.06,0:34:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没到17岁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.49,0:35:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我抗议！- 我抗议！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.16,0:35:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把什么都当作阴谋！ - 安静，让我想想！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.29,0:35:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全都是阴谋！ - 我抗议
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 我抗议！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.83,0:35:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把自己的名字放到火焰杯里去了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.87,0:35:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有，先生 - 那是你让高年级的学生…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.20,0:35:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …替你做的？ - 没有，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你绝对肯定？ - 是的，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.04,0:35:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可他显然在撒谎 - 他没有
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.48,0:35:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,火焰杯有非常强大的魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有超强的魔法才能胜过它
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.31,0:35:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个四年级的学生是 不可能掌握那种魔法的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.48,0:35:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯眼汉，看来你有点想法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.65,0:35:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡卡洛夫，你没忘了我当年的职责 就是揣摩黑暗巫师的想法吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.99,0:35:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …可能你还记得 - 别这样，阿拉斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.86,0:35:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂，就交给你决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.53,0:35:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则是不能改的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.94,0:36:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,火焰杯组成了一个必须遵守的魔法契约
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.21,0:36:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特先生没有选择
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.21,0:36:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就今夜而言，他的确是…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.35,0:36:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…三强赛的勇士
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.31,0:36:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能这样下去了，阿不思
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是黑魔标记，然后又是这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.78,0:36:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,米勒娃，你想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.95,0:36:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给这些画上句号
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.49,0:36:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让波特参赛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.66,0:36:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到巴蒂说的了，规则很明确
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.29,0:37:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让巴蒂和他的规则见鬼去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.30,0:37:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾几何时，你开始迎合魔法部了？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.90,0:37:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,校长，我觉得要说这都是巧合的确难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.07,0:37:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，如果想揭开这一系列事件的谜底
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.17,0:37:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们也许应该…暂时…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.68,0:37:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…任其发展下去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.11,0:37:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？袖手旁观么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.45,0:37:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他当成诱饵？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.09,0:37:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是，波特是个孩子 而不是一块肉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.82,0:37:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意西弗勒斯的观点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.13,0:37:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉斯特，能帮忙照看一下哈利么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.23,0:37:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 但别让他知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.97,0:37:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道未来的磨难…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.60,0:37:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他一定已经很紧张了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.64,0:37:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.09,0:38:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.36,0:38:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，已经不重要了 至少也该让你的铁哥们知道一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.16,0:38:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让你知道什么？ - 你心里明白得很
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.63,0:38:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，我不想事情这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.50,0:38:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.27,0:38:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在表现象个傻瓜 - 对，我就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.94,0:38:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩·韦斯莱 哈利·波特的傻朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.18,0:38:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没把名字放进火焰杯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.58,0:38:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对永恒的荣耀不感兴趣 我只是想…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.19,0:38:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我对今晚发生的事毫无头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.83,0:38:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就这么发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.93,0:38:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.31,0:38:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎扯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,多有魅力的四人组啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.89,0:39:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.36,0:39:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是丽塔·斯基特
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:20.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,为《预言家日报》写稿的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，你们是知道我的了 我们不了解的是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.84,0:39:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们才是生动新闻的来源
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.84,0:39:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玫瑰色的脸颊下 隐藏了什么样的奇思怪想？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,强壮的肌肉裹着多少秘密？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.89,0:39:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,弯曲的卷发下面又藏着多少勇气？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.29,0:39:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙们，什么才是勇士的标志？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.83,0:39:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己就很想知道 更别提我饥渴的读者们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.30,0:39:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…谁先来说说？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.10,0:39:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该从最小的开始？ 多可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.98,0:40:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里比较清静
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.35,0:40:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是扫把间
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.42,0:40:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就更有家的感觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.92,0:40:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用速记笔你不介意吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.86,0:40:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.80,0:40:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，哈利，告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你，一个年仅12岁的男孩坐在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.03,0:40:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是14
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.70,0:40:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对的是其他三位学生…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.84,0:40:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他们不仅仅在心智上比你成熟许多…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.28,0:40:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,…而且掌握了就你连…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.05,0:40:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…做梦都不敢想的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.08,0:40:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，没有认真考虑过
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.09,0:40:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管那支笔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.42,0:40:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，你不是一个普通的12岁男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.13,0:40:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是14 - 你有传奇般的过去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.50,0:40:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是自己过去的创伤…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.83,0:41:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…导致现在你急于想参加一场 如此危险的比赛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.24,0:41:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不是我要参加的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.17,0:41:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.04,0:41:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点叛逆心理大家才喜欢呢，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,划掉最后一句
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.28,0:41:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到你父母 如果他们还健在，你认为他们会怎么看？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.62,0:41:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是骄傲，还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.59,0:41:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…忧虑你选择了这样一个 病态的寻求关注的方法…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.59,0:41:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…病态的找死心理？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.19,0:41:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是眨下眼睛 没和你说那么多吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.56,0:42:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，我不能冒险让海德薇过来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.07,0:42:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从世界杯以后 魔法部拦截了越来越多的猫头鹰…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.50,0:42:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…她太容易被认出了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.91,0:42:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈，哈利 面对面
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,周六晚一点和我在格兰芬多公休室见
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.28,0:42:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保你是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.22,0:42:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天狼星
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.88,0:42:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.55,0:42:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只鸟会咬人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.70,0:42:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天狼星？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.02,0:42:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特，12岁…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.09,0:43:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…三强争霸赛的神秘参赛者
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.22,0:43:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼中散发幽灵般往事的阴影…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.99,0:43:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,…含着泪花…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.04,0:43:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天狼星，你怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的时间不多，哈利 让我直入主题
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.48,0:43:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有把你的名字放进火焰杯里？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.58,0:43:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.65,0:43:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我必须问的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.09,0:43:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在和我讲讲你的梦 你提到了虫尾巴和伏地魔
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但房间里第三个人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.66,0:43:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 你没听到他的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.00,0:43:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.43,0:43:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔给他一个任务 很重要的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.34,0:43:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.81,0:43:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.61,0:43:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…抓我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:44:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白，但他会利用这个人来抓我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.45,0:44:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这可能只是个梦而已
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.99,0:44:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.79,0:44:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个梦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.09,0:44:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.69,0:44:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界杯时食死徒的出现 你的名字出现在火焰杯里…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.33,0:44:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都不是巧合 霍格沃茨不再安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.50,0:44:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.77,0:44:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说恶魔就在你身边 伊戈尔·卡卡洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.21,0:44:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经是食死徒 食死徒魔性难改
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.04,0:44:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂·克劳奇，一个铁石心肠的人。他把自己儿子送去了阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.99,0:44:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们其中的一个把我的名字放进去的？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.26,0:44:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.72,0:44:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但不管是谁，他一定不是你的朋友 争霸赛里会出人命的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.86,0:44:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小天狼星，我还没有做好准备 - 你没得选择
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.90,0:44:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人来了 - 哈利，和你的朋友搞好关系
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.61,0:45:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在和谁说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.11,0:45:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？屋子里又没人 - 我听见声音了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.45,0:45:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你又开始胡想了 这也不是第一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.98,0:45:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是你在准备下一次的访谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.55,0:45:30.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（幼年惨剧）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.25,0:45:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,太奇妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.85,0:45:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太奇妙了 - 纳威，你又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.12,0:45:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.39,0:45:52.38,Title,0,0,0,0,,《拉克斯高地的魔力水生物》？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.56,0:45:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆迪那天喝茶的时候给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.23,0:45:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正也当着这么多人的面了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.13,0:46:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不如自己去说算了？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.70,0:46:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，这是你自己的问题，和我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.21,0:46:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想让我说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.48,0:46:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.75,0:46:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩想让我告诉你 希姆告诉他…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.48,0:46:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…帕瓦蒂告诉蒂姆 海格在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.25,0:46:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是么？那你…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.86,0:46:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.03,0:46:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的要这样吗？ - 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.77,0:46:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕瓦蒂告诉蒂姆…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.97,0:46:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我再说一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.58,0:46:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.54,0:46:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以告诉罗纳得… - 我不是猫头鹰！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.16,0:46:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上你父亲的隐形衣了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.59,0:47:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我带了 海格，我们要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.36,0:47:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意哦，这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.87,0:47:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这朵花是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.37,0:47:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格，你居然梳了头？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.17,0:47:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确梳过了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.34,0:47:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许以后你也应该试一试
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.79,0:47:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,海格？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.16,0:47:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形衣，披上隐形衣！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.60,0:47:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好，奥林 - 噢，海格
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不会来了 我还以为…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你把我给忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.91,0:47:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会呢，奥林
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.51,0:47:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想给我看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.02,0:48:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早前谈话时，你显得那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.59,0:48:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…愉悦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.66,0:48:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会不虚此行的 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.07,0:48:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们靠近些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.65,0:48:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.28,0:48:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是第一项任务？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.18,0:48:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开玩笑 - 别这样，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.49,0:48:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一种被严重误解的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.62,0:48:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，好悬！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.59,0:48:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我得承认那条匈牙利树蜂确实很凶恶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.90,0:48:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩只是看了一下就差点昏过去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.24,0:48:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩来过？ - 当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.44,0:48:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他哥哥查理把它们从罗马尼亚带来的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩没告诉你？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.51,0:48:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.65,0:49:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一个字都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.46,0:49:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你作弊，波特 - 你真讨厌，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.06,0:49:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运，波特 - 波特真讨厌！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.90,0:49:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塞德里克必胜 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.64,0:49:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢我的徽章么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.87,0:49:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.78,0:49:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.81,0:49:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看徽章吧，波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.95,0:49:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能和你谈谈么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.42,0:49:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 你真差劲，波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.45,0:49:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波特，你真讨厌！ - 哈利波特真差劲！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.96,0:49:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙是我们的第一项任务
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.70,0:49:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每个人都有一条 - 塞德里克！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.00,0:49:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.80,0:49:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙蓉和克鲁姆他们知道么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.00,0:49:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道 - 塞德里克，别和他罗嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.44,0:50:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 他不配
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.08,0:50:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看徽章吧，波特！ - 听着，那个徽章
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.74,0:50:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫他们不要戴… - 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.95,0:50:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我想它们爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.08,0:50:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事老是发生在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.72,0:50:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得承认，那火焰很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.96,0:50:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真窝囊，知道么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.96,0:50:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是么？ - 就是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.39,0:50:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.90,0:50:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有，离我远点 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.77,0:50:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波特来了，他是个骗子 - 火气好大，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.14,0:50:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和父亲打了个赌
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.71,0:50:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你在比赛里只能坚持10分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.48,0:50:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不同意 他认为只有5分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.58,0:50:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管你爸怎么想呢，马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.69,0:50:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他既卑鄙又凶残 你只是个可怜虫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.59,0:50:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可怜虫？ - 小子，你可别这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.36,0:50:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来教教你怎么在人背后下咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.43,0:51:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个讨厌鬼，懦夫，渣滓…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.44,0:51:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 穆迪教授！ - …小人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.34,0:51:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干吗？ - 教学生
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.28,0:51:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是，那是个学生么？ - 从技术上来说是只雪貂
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.05,0:51:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,站稳了，别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.97,0:51:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会告诉老爸的！ - 你在威胁我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.34,0:51:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 教授！ - 你在威胁我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.44,0:51:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.47,0:51:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老爸的糗事我知道的可多呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.21,0:51:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿拉斯特 - 走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.08,0:51:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉斯特，我们从不用变形魔法惩罚学生！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.05,0:51:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓不利多肯定告诉过你这点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.79,0:51:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他可能提过 - 那么你这次要好好记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.36,0:51:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,都走开！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.93,0:52:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.37,0:52:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是面照妖镜
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.17,0:52:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,防范敌人用的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能看见他们的眼白 那说明他们就在我身后
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.31,0:52:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,懒得和你讲那里面是什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.95,0:52:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了你也不信
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.25,0:52:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你打算怎么对付那些龙？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.36,0:53:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…嗯…我想可能会…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.13,0:53:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.34,0:53:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.74,0:53:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友迪戈里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.08,0:53:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你这么大的时候 就能把口哨变成一快会报时的表
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.68,0:53:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉库尔小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.35,0:53:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是神话中的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.59,0:53:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于克鲁姆，他可能头脑简单…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.32,0:53:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但卡卡洛夫不是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.66,0:53:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是有备而来的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.66,0:53:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,会利用克鲁姆的优势
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.97,0:53:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.70,0:53:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么优势？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.37,0:53:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.91,0:53:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我会飞，飞得很快，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.88,0:54:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听说了，可不是一般得好 - 但不许用扫把啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.08,0:54:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以用…魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.16,0:54:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,下注了！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.79,0:54:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,下注了！来这赌一把！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.13,0:54:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都来下注吧，出小钱赢大钱
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.23,0:54:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,明智就投克鲁姆！还有谁要下？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.27,0:54:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,您呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.10,0:54:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,10比1赌芙蓉赢，拿好了 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.34,0:54:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.51,0:54:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天对大家来说是伟大的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.55,0:54:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,每项任务都很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.95,0:54:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛中请不要离开自己的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.82,0:54:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会降低你的风险
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.73,0:54:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利，是你么？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.33,0:54:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我们都希望勇士们…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.20,0:54:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得怎样？还好么？ - …有好的运气
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.57,0:54:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键要集中精神 此后，你只需要…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.14,0:55:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,斗龙
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.28,0:55:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的爱情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.48,0:55:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.22,0:55:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…让人激动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.19,0:55:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天如果有什么不幸…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.53,0:55:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你们俩还可以上头版呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.46,0:55:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,关你什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.87,0:55:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座帐篷是给勇士…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.24,0:55:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…及亲友专用的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.74,0:55:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓，我们已经得到想要的了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.05,0:55:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好，勇士们 请靠过来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.02,0:55:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，你们期待的一刻终于到来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.39,0:55:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你们四个才能体会的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.79,0:55:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰杰小姐，你在这干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.23,0:55:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我就走
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.06,0:55:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂，袋子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.03,0:56:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇士们，围着我站成一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.43,0:56:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉库尔小姐，到这里 克鲁姆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.70,0:56:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特…波特先生，到这里 好，现在
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.81,0:56:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…德拉库尔小姐，请
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.31,0:56:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔士绿龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.62,0:56:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁姆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.93,0:56:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国火球龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.30,0:56:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞典短鼻龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.17,0:56:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 剩下的就是… - 树蜂龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.34,0:56:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了，孩子？ - 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.01,0:56:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈牙利树蜂龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.58,0:56:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些代表了四头实实在在的龙…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.89,0:56:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…每只守护着一个金蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.12,0:56:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的目标很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.76,0:56:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到金蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.43,0:57:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你们必须做到 因为每个蛋都有一个线索…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.60,0:57:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…没有线索便无法进行下一任务
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.27,0:57:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，好运，勇士们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.47,0:57:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪戈里先生，大炮一响，你就…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.92,0:57:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪戈里！迪戈里！迪戈里！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.33,0:57:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,三位勇士已经斗败了龙…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.87,0:57:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他们也将继续下一任务
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.94,0:57:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，欢迎第四位也是最后一位参赛者
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.01,0:57:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！哈利！哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.68,0:59:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,用魔杖，哈利，用魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.12,0:59:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.15,0:59:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好耶！ - 好！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.23,0:59:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，老天
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.31,1:00:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊！ - 龙，干得好！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.59,1:02:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！ 好！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.99,1:03:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好样的，哈利 - 就知道你死不了，可能会断条腿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.86,1:03:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者少条胳膊 - 但要你死？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.96,1:03:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没门！ - 没门！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.83,1:03:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.63,1:03:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，快看看 线索是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.33,1:03:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要我打开么？ - 要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.97,1:03:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要我打开么？ - 要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.68,1:03:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.22,1:03:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，大伙 回去做自己的事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.13,1:03:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定很让人尴尬了 就算不让你们听那噪音
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.33,1:03:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在了解你一定是疯了才会 把名字放到火焰杯里去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.67,1:03:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在想清楚了？ 这么长时间
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.54,1:03:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是我一个人这么想的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.81,1:04:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.28,1:04:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 这让我感到“好过”多了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.45,1:04:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少，龙的事情是我给你报的信 - 是海格告诉我的呀
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.02,1:04:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，是我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.66,1:04:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不记得 我叫赫敏告诉你…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.86,1:04:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…希姆告诉我说帕瓦蒂和蒂姆说 海格在找你
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.10,1:04:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,希姆没告诉我任何事 其实都只是我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.04,1:04:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你想明白了…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.27,1:04:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…咱们之间就没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.64,1:04:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能想明白啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.98,1:04:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全逻辑混乱
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.58,1:04:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说不是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.78,1:04:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我当时是太着急了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.42,1:04:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩们毛病真多
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.58,1:05:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好，哈利 - 你好，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.65,1:05:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,秋，哈利在看你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.19,1:05:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出声
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.60,1:05:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧这个！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.97,1:05:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直不敢相信她又故技重施
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.50,1:05:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰杰小姐 一位平凡却又野心勃勃的女孩…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.91,1:05:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…似乎开始钟情于著名的巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.84,1:05:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,据悉，她最新的猎物是…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.28,1:05:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,…保加利亚猛男威克多尔·克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.21,1:05:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于哈利·波特如何看待此事 目前仍没有消息
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.52,1:05:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯莱先生，你的包裹
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.62,1:05:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，耐吉尔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.93,1:05:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行，耐吉尔 等会
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.60,1:06:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.47,1:06:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我许诺要给他哈利的签名的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.44,1:06:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，我妈给我寄的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.35,1:06:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是条裙子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.36,1:06:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的眼睛很配 还有女帽么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.63,1:06:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.00,1:06:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金妮，这肯定是给你的 - 我才不穿呢，真让人恶心
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.70,1:06:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.70,1:06:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是给金妮的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.81,1:06:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是给你的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.18,1:06:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 礼袍 - 礼袍，干嘛用的？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.18,1:06:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞舞会…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.52,1:06:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是三强赛的传统项目…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.59,1:06:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…从首届就开始
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:07:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在平安夜，我们的客人和我们…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.36,1:07:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…将会在大厅…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.20,1:07:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…举行一场礼仪庄重的晚会
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.80,1:07:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为主办方学校的代表…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.24,1:07:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我希望你们每个人拿出最好的姿态
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.64,1:07:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是认真的，因为…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…圣诞晚会首先是一个…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.75,1:07:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…舞会
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.49,1:07:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.49,1:07:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈德里克·格兰芬多学院 10个世纪以来已经赢得了…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.66,1:07:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…魔法届的普遍尊重
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.47,1:07:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你们在一夜之间因为 表现得像…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.70,1:07:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一群胡作非为的狒狒而把 这个名字玷污
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.64,1:07:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试说5倍快？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.78,1:07:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，说到跳舞…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.45,1:07:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是让身体呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.32,1:07:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个女孩体内，都有一只天鹅…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.82,1:08:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…振翅欲飞
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.36,1:08:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱洛斯·米根身体里也要蹦出东西来了 但我想不是天鹅
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.53,1:08:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在每个男孩体内 有一只狮子准备要猎食
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.83,1:08:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦斯莱先生 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.23,1:08:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能加入我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.27,1:08:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的右手放在我的腰上
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.98,1:08:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放那里？ - 我的腰上
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.71,1:08:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且伸直你的骼膊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.72,1:08:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请放音乐
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.75,1:08:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,1，2，3
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.92,1:08:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,1，2，3，1，2，3
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.13,1:08:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们得把这个故事流传下去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.43,1:08:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到永远 - 到永远
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.77,1:08:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都来加入我们 男孩们，都站起来！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.73,1:09:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们为什么总是聚在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.83,1:09:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么才能和其中的一个说话？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.34,1:09:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,管它，哈利，你和龙战斗过 若连你都找不到舞伴，还能有谁可以？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.01,1:09:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这比斗龙也容易不到哪去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.48,1:09:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我长的像我妈
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.22,1:09:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对她了解不多 我3岁时，她就离开了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.32,1:09:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那么伤心
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.43,1:09:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我父亲却伤心透了 我父亲是个小个子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.16,1:09:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在6岁时就可以轻松举起 我的父亲，然后把他放到衣橱里
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.87,1:09:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总为这个笑的很厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.27,1:10:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.08,1:10:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他在我上学的时候也去世了…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.98,1:10:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要自己照顾自己
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.45,1:10:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要说我了 说说关于你的事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太疯狂了 也许只有我们没有舞伴了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.25,1:10:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.15,1:10:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他至少可以带自己去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.55,1:10:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说他已经找到舞伴了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.36,1:10:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我真的很郁闷
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.97,1:11:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找一个好舞伴 不然都被别人抢走了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.47,1:11:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和谁去？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.18,1:11:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安吉莉娜？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.05,1:11:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…想和我一起参加舞会吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.68,1:11:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞会？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.59,1:11:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.76,1:11:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.49,1:11:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是个女的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.30,1:11:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于注意到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.80,1:11:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以选择我们其中一个
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.37,1:11:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧，男孩单身还过得去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.44,1:11:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你个女孩子，太惨无人睹了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.11,1:11:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会单身去的 不管你信不信，已经有人邀请我了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.82,1:11:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我也答应了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.66,1:11:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.42,1:12:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她吹牛
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.26,1:12:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.20,1:12:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样我们也得找个人跟我们去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.67,1:12:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天回休息室之时 都要带上自己得舞伴，同意？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.74,1:12:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.66,1:12:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 秋 - 哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.57,1:12:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心楼梯，上面比较滑
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.47,1:12:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.51,1:12:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,秋？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.51,1:12:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.45,1:12:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…你能不能…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.85,1:12:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你能不能做我舞伴？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.32,1:13:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，我没听清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.49,1:13:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以邀请你做我的舞伴吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.43,1:13:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.17,1:13:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…对不起 已经有人邀请我了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.01,1:13:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.11,1:13:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也答应他了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.01,1:13:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也好，没事，挺好的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.88,1:13:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的，没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.92,1:13:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.79,1:13:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.16,1:13:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.13,1:13:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.54,1:13:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.21,1:13:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩，真的没事，无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.58,1:14:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.71,1:14:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚才去邀请芙蓉·德拉库尔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.05,1:14:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 她怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.72,1:14:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是不
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.65,1:14:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 难道同意了？ - 别傻了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.39,1:14:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是刚好路过 你知道我很喜欢她走路的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.56,1:14:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不住自己 话就从嘴里溜了出来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.37,1:14:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上，他是冲她大声吼叫 很吓人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.01,1:14:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后你呢？ - 还能怎么样，我跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.78,1:14:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我摆脱不了这阴影了 真不知道自己怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.68,1:14:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，哈利 - 嗨，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.08,1:14:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是看到她们的背影
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.49,1:14:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看她是永远不会原谅我的了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.69,1:14:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.77,1:15:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要命
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.71,1:15:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要命
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.98,1:15:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要命…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.45,1:15:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，要命…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.39,1:15:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿的什么？ 你穿的什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.26,1:15:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的礼袍 - 嗯，它们还好吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.46,1:15:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有花边、没有讨厌的衣领
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.56,1:15:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你的更传统
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.67,1:15:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,传统？简直是古董！ 让我看上去像婶婶泰茜
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.07,1:15:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻着也像婶婶泰茜
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.88,1:15:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.12,1:15:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱想了！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.65,1:15:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子 我打赌她肯定一个人在房间里哭呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.26,1:15:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 当然是赫敏啦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.89,1:15:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不明白吗，哈利 否则她为什么不告诉我们她跟谁来？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.66,1:16:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她怕我们取笑她
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.03,1:16:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人邀请她 她要是不那么傲气，我就去请她了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.11,1:16:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们好 - 你们好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.67,1:16:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣服真是…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.08,1:16:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…有个性
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.85,1:16:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算找到你了波特 你和佩蒂尔小姐准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.18,1:16:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么准备好，教授？ - 跳舞啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.18,1:16:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是老规矩了，三个冠军选手 现在是四个了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.39,1:16:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…最先入场跳舞
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.79,1:16:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相当肯定我告诉你了 - 您没有
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.99,1:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在也知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.23,1:16:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你，韦斯莱先生 你也可以和佩蒂尔小姐一起进礼堂了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.70,1:16:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们也来了 - 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.27,1:16:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.64,1:16:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.31,1:16:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨！- 大家排好队…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.48,1:16:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你可迟到了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.05,1:16:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走，跟上
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.16,1:16:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真美！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.56,1:17:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.54,1:17:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是赫敏·格兰杰和威克多尔·克鲁姆吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.75,1:17:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能，怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.02,1:18:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.33,1:18:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，挽着我的腰
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.20,1:18:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.20,1:19:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.64,1:19:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆动你们的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.67,1:19:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,学着摇摆起来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.54,1:19:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,像疯狂的小精灵那样转啊转
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.65,1:19:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他那样舞动
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.18,1:19:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,像独角兽那样摇摆
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.69,1:19:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直到黎明
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.29,1:19:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中舞动你的手
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.33,1:19:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像老女人一样，什么都不管
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.80,1:19:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能像飞马那样跳舞吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.80,1:19:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不觉得他像个红色的南瓜吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.17,1:20:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他就像图书馆到处乱放的书
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.51,1:20:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以邀你一起吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.21,1:20:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,手，腿，都是你的了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.84,1:20:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很帅，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.11,1:20:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,威克多尔去拿酒了 你们也一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.61,1:20:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我们可不想打扰你跟威克多尔
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.99,1:20:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发什么神经？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.62,1:20:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是德姆斯特朗学校的 你居然跟敌人这么亲密
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.49,1:20:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人？是谁一直想要他的亲笔签名？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.76,1:20:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说，比赛的目的…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.37,1:21:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是促进国际间的魔法交流…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.47,1:21:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…广交朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.70,1:21:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他可不只是想交朋友那么简单
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.85,1:21:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想不想和我跳舞？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.35,1:21:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.03,1:21:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在利用你 - 你怎么能这样说？！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.63,1:21:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能处理好我自己的事情 - 我倒不觉得，他对你来说太老了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.00,1:21:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？！什么？你竟然真的这样认为？ - 没错，我就是这样想的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.84,1:21:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你应该有好点子了？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.14,1:21:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续说 - 下次再有舞会的时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.31,1:21:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…鼓起勇气 在别人邀请我之前邀请我！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.62,1:21:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是最后的替补
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.82,1:21:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你完完全全偏题了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.19,1:21:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.99,1:21:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.46,1:21:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系！都去睡觉吧，你们两个
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.76,1:22:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她年纪越大越可怕！ - 罗恩，你把一切都搞砸了！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.97,1:22:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.11,1:22:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不要让
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.91,1:22:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这魔法消逝
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.02,1:22:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.11,1:23:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我再看一次
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.52,1:23:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，时辰就快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.12,1:23:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，终于！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.29,1:23:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让开，虫尾巴 让我来好好招待一下我们的客人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.24,1:23:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.08,1:23:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚好经过
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.45,1:24:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.96,1:24:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，几星期前你就说 你已经解开金蛋之谜了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.40,1:24:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离下个任务只有两天了 - 是吗？我也没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.14,1:24:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜威克多尔已经解出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.11,1:24:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道，我们从来没有 讨论过比赛的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.14,1:24:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我们都不怎么说话 威克多尔更像是一个身体强健的人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.48,1:24:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是他不太唠叨
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.15,1:24:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数时候他就看着我学习
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.19,1:24:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实这样挺讨厌的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.66,1:24:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会解开金蛋之谜的对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.20,1:24:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.30,1:24:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个任务只是对你的一个考验…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.47,1:24:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,用最残忍和最残酷方式
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.77,1:25:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.74,1:25:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我都为你担惊受怕
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.58,1:25:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你上次勇敢地战胜了火龙
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.78,1:25:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这次就不一定了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.45,1:25:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，波特！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.89,1:25:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波特！ - 塞德里克
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.10,1:25:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.83,1:25:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,精心备战中
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.77,1:25:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实还没有好好谢谢你 告诉我巨龙的事
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.77,1:25:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 如果你是我，你也会这样做的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.41,1:25:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.08,1:25:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道五楼的浴室吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.49,1:25:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个不错的洗澡的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.46,1:25:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上你的蛋…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.09,1:25:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在热水里好好想想
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.03,1:26:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.41,1:26:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确是疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.25,1:26:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你我会把它放到水里试试
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.69,1:26:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃金娘！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.75,1:26:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.22,1:26:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.76,1:27:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天我在一处截流处玩耍的时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.60,1:27:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我看到了一种变身水
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.21,1:27:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要做坏孩子哦，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.71,1:27:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身水？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.24,1:27:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃金娘，你是说把它放到水里试一试吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.09,1:27:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是那样做的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.62,1:27:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个男孩…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.69,1:27:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…很帅的那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.06,1:27:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…塞德里克
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.70,1:27:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，打开它吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.48,1:27:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺着歌声来寻觅我们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.65,1:28:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能在陆地上歌唱
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.49,1:28:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一个小时的时间来找到我们
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.59,1:28:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,取回我们带走的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.44,1:28:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃金娘…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.34,1:28:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…黑湖里面没有人鱼是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.68,1:28:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.22,1:28:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞德里克想了好久才想出来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.09,1:28:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎所有的泡泡都没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.51,1:28:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，你再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.18,1:29:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,“顺着歌声来寻觅我们在哪里”
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.18,1:29:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显是黑湖
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.72,1:29:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,“一小时之内你一定要找到”
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.42,1:29:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是很明显，一定是困难重重
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.26,1:29:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,困难重重？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.30,1:29:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候在水下呆过一个小时？赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.10,1:29:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，我们一定能想出办法 我们三个一定能想出来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.60,1:29:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场热烈的会议该停止了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.27,1:29:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦格教授在她办公室等你们
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.51,1:29:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你，波特 就你们两个，韦斯莱和格兰杰
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.08,1:29:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师但是 离第二个任务只剩下几小时了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.91,1:29:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，我想波特已经准备好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.68,1:29:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,…该去睡个好觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.72,1:29:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！立刻！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.20,1:29:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,隆巴顿！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.17,1:29:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮波特收拾一下书
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.84,1:30:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你对植物感兴趣…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.21,1:30:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…那你应该按着 这本书的向导去学草药学
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.42,1:30:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗在尼泊尔面有个巫师吗？ 他种出了反重心的树
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.92,1:30:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威，恕我冒犯…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.26,1:30:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我对植物一点都不敢兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.33,1:30:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在如果…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.20,1:30:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…有一种魔法芜箐 能让我在水下呼吸一小时…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.17,1:30:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…那才是我真正要的，否则
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.84,1:30:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不了解芜箐 但是你可以用呼吸草
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.81,1:30:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快下注！ - 快下注！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.88,1:30:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家来啊，不要害羞.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.51,1:30:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三个男生 - 一个女生
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.12,1:30:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 四个都下去了 - 但都能上来吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.45,1:30:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么低级
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.59,1:30:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁还要下注？ - 芙蓉一赔一
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.59,1:30:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定这能行吗，纳威？ - 肯定行
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.76,1:30:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维持一个小时？ - 应该会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.86,1:30:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.53,1:30:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得看情况…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.90,1:31:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…有的能活跃于淡水，有的则喜欢咸水
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.53,1:31:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么现在才告诉我？ 开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.37,1:31:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.51,1:31:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样，你的主意 比赫敏和罗恩的好多了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.78,1:31:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.71,1:31:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看上去有点紧张，哈利 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.75,1:31:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到第二场比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.16,1:31:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚，我们从各个选手那儿 取走一样东西
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.03,1:31:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样财富
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.56,1:31:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人的财富…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.37,1:31:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都被安置于黑湖之中
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.23,1:31:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,获胜的标准是…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.97,1:31:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…找到你们的财富然后安全抵达湖面
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.97,1:31:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有了这个就太简单了 - 把呼吸草放到你的嘴里
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.78,1:31:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只能维持一小时 记住只有一小时
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.58,1:31:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过一小时就没救了 魔法也救不了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.98,1:31:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以在炮声后开始
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.78,1:32:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么了？ - 不知道，我看不到他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.05,1:32:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪 是我害了哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.89,1:32:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.96,1:32:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.17,1:33:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布斯巴顿的选手 德拉库尔小姐…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.48,1:33:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…很不幸被迫退出…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.65,1:34:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…无法再继续接下来的比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.53,1:35:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她也是我的朋友！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.96,1:35:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能救一个！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.05,1:36:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.89,1:36:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.29,1:37:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.14,1:37:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.45,1:37:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.45,1:38:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.12,1:38:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事，巴蒂！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.72,1:38:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给他拿块毛巾 - 所有的裁判过来集合！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.76,1:38:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了她，尽管你可以不用救她
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.90,1:38:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.00,1:38:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.37,1:38:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你，你也帮了她
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.74,1:38:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩，就那么一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.98,1:38:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利！ - 赫敏！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.32,1:38:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？ 你一定冻坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.22,1:38:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常钦佩你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.32,1:38:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是最后一名，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.19,1:38:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数第二 芙蓉退出了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.50,1:38:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.90,1:38:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊！干得漂亮！ - 安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.14,1:38:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意了！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.21,1:39:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,获胜者是迪戈里先生…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.51,1:39:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他使用气泡膜帮助呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.18,1:39:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特本来可以第一个上岸…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.02,1:39:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但是他救了韦斯莱以后…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.16,1:39:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…还毅然决定营救他人 我们同意授予他…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.60,1:39:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…第二名…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.77,1:39:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第二名！ - 干得漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.43,1:39:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…因为他舍己为人的精神！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.34,1:39:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.38,1:39:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 舍己为人的精神？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.34,1:39:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 舍己为人？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.15,1:39:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏事在你手里也变成好事
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.68,1:39:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做的好，舍己为人的孩子 - 恭喜你波特
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.52,1:39:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 战绩不错 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.35,1:39:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.06,1:39:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等会在海格那儿见，哈利 - 抱歉，我们一直都没有机会谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.46,1:39:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经听了很多遍你的故事了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.46,1:39:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,印象深刻，真的 当然，也很悲伤…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.10,1:39:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…失去了家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.10,1:40:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法再次团聚，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.51,1:40:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是生活还得继续…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.28,1:40:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…迎接新的一天到来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.82,1:40:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢肯定你父母一定会为你骄傲的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.72,1:40:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.35,1:40:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想让波特夏天去你那里打工吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.66,1:40:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次你带去的那个小男孩 就一直没有回来过！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.34,1:40:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还说我是疯子！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.52,1:40:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们初次见面还记忆犹新
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.42,1:40:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我见过的最奇怪的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.96,1:40:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是让我想到我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.70,1:40:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 四年后的我们 - 我们还是那张脸
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.90,1:41:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，也许吧 但我们却是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.40,1:41:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，还有哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.14,1:41:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很快就会成为 最年轻的三强赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.71,1:41:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,万岁！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.18,1:41:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨，霍格沃茨 霍格，沃茨，霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.85,1:41:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,教我们一些东西吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.46,1:41:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳奇先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.04,1:41:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人死在这儿，福吉 而且他不会是最后一个，你应该采取行动
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.81,1:41:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不行
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.54,1:41:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种非常时期，巫师界希望 得到他们的领导的支持，邓不利多
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.78,1:41:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们自己看看！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.28,1:41:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,三强争霸赛不会被取消 我不会让别人认为我是胆小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.55,1:41:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的领导人只会做正确的事 他不会管别人怎么想
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.92,1:41:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是在对我说话吗？ - 抱歉，先生
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.89,1:42:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的对话已经不再是秘密了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.90,1:42:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.64,1:42:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴又见到你哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.77,1:42:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以等会再来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.47,1:42:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，没事了我跟部长已经谈好了 我等会就回来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.98,1:42:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,您请，部长
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.08,1:42:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的帽子，先生
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.25,1:42:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，不用拘束，自己拿糖吃
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.09,1:42:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我提醒你，他们很难应付
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.75,1:44:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.52,1:44:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 教授 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.96,1:44:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊戈尔·卡卡洛夫应你要求 把你从阿兹卡班带到议会提供证据…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.90,1:44:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…如果你的证词无误
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.00,1:44:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,证据确凿…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.87,1:44:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…议会将考虑将你当场释放
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.11,1:44:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在，你仍是一个有罪的食死徒
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.88,1:44:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接受对你的条款吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.15,1:44:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我接受，长官 - 你有什么证据？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.19,1:44:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有名单，长官
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.19,1:44:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个人叫罗斯，埃文·罗斯
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.46,1:44:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗斯已经死了 - 就会胡扯一些事来搬弄是非…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.17,1:44:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …不是吗？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.47,1:44:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是你能提供的所有证据吗？ - 不，不
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.27,1:45:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还个人叫洛克伍德，他是一个间谍
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.74,1:45:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂部门的奥古斯·洛克伍德？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.28,1:45:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，就是他
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.64,1:45:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把消息发送到外面去的给“那个人”
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.55,1:45:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，议会会考虑的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.99,1:45:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前你还要被遣送回阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.12,1:45:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不要！等一下，我还有 斯内普！西弗勒斯·斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.03,1:45:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,议会应该看过我呈上的证据
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.16,1:45:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯·斯内普曾经确实是食死徒 但是他在伏地魔垮台之前…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.30,1:45:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …就加入了我们的行列 - 他在撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.47,1:45:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天他已经不再是食死徒了 - 他还是对黑暗魔头效忠的！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.07,1:45:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.98,1:45:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非证人还能提供其他人的名字…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.58,1:45:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…否则本庭宣布结束
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.88,1:45:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，不，不，不！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.89,1:45:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道一个
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.52,1:45:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 名字
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.26,1:45:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯？ - 我知道的…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.89,1:45:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他还参与了绑架…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.09,1:45:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,…还用了诅咒魔法…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.43,1:45:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…折磨弗兰克·隆巴顿和他的妻子！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.10,1:46:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字 告诉我这个卑劣的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.60,1:46:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂·克劳奇…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.84,1:46:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…小巴蒂·克劳奇
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.35,1:46:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.69,1:46:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开你们的手！ 你们这些可怜的人！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.03,1:46:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.03,1:46:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.41,1:46:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇不是罪过，哈利 但是你要小心谨慎
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.25,1:46:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是记忆盘
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.82,1:46:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言非常有用 当脑子里的事情杂乱无章时
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.66,1:47:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以用它再来回顾一下 我做过的事
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.66,1:47:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗哈利，我搜索了很久…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.80,1:47:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…想找一些细节…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.77,1:47:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一些我没有注意到的事…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.07,1:47:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一些能解开噩耗之谜的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.07,1:47:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次感觉就快要找到了 线索又消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.01,1:47:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是心急如焚啊
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.95,1:47:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师？克劳奇的儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.49,1:47:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.72,1:47:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,被遣送到阿兹卡班去了 这对巴蒂的打击很大
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.19,1:47:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他也没有选择 证据确凿
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.27,1:47:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你问这干嘛？ - 只是我…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.00,1:47:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我梦见过他
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.37,1:47:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在夏天，开学以前
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.31,1:47:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在梦里，我在一幢房子里
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.52,1:48:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔也在那里 只有他不是人形
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.45,1:48:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫尾巴也在那里 还有克劳奇的儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.46,1:48:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其它的梦都跟这个一样？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.13,1:48:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是重复做同一个
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.80,1:48:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师，这些梦…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.30,1:48:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我所看到的 你不认为它是在真的发生，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.14,1:48:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你还是不要去多想这些梦了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.61,1:48:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得最好你…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.22,1:48:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…把这些都忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.26,1:48:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个信号，西弗勒斯 你和我都知道这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.94,1:48:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.31,1:49:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.95,1:49:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你，你在黑湖里面所用的是…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.89,1:49:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸草，我说的对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.93,1:49:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，老师
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.39,1:49:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.63,1:49:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少人知道呼吸草
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.40,1:49:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是很难弄到的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.61,1:49:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个也同样
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.75,1:49:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.72,1:49:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,泡泡汁，老师？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.72,1:49:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它其效无比
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.36,1:49:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要三滴就能让你 最私处的秘密暴露无遗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.23,1:49:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是对学生使用它是绝对禁止的 但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.06,1:49:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你要是再敢从我的 私人收藏中偷东西的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.27,1:50:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…说不定我不小心就 撒一点在你的南瓜脑袋里
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.31,1:50:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没偷过任何东西 - 不要跟我说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.85,1:50:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸草也许不是你做的 但是毒蛇皮和苍蝇翅膀呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.25,1:50:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的伙伴还拿了变身水 相信我…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.76,1:50:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我一定会查出真相的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.78,1:50:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊！ - 好！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.57,1:51:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.34,1:51:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早时穆迪教授 把火焰杯放到了迷宫的深处
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.85,1:51:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他才知道放到了哪里 由于迪戈里…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.92,1:51:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…和波特…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.59,1:51:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…并列第一…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.50,1:51:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他们将最先进入迷宫 接着是克鲁姆…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.87,1:51:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后是德拉库尔 - 加油！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.21,1:51:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先拿到奖杯的选手将成为冠军！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.65,1:51:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师们会在周围巡视
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.55,1:51:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在比赛时 如果有任何选手想退出比赛…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.65,1:51:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他或她只要用魔棒发送信号弹
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.49,1:52:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,选手们过来！快一点！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.53,1:52:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在迷宫里 没有龙也没有水妖
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.04,1:52:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有更高的挑战
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.57,1:52:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,人会在里面发生变化
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.78,1:52:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量找到火焰杯
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.64,1:52:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是要小心，否则你会迷失自我
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.88,1:52:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,选手们准备好！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.93,1:52:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.80,1:52:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子 - 一会见，父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.10,1:52:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数三下，一…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.48,1:56:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙蓉？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.38,1:56:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,芙蓉
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.39,1:56:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.89,1:57:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.93,1:57:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.30,1:57:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.14,1:57:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不要，停手 他被施了巫术，塞德里克！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.51,1:57:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让开！ - 他被施了巫术！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.19,1:57:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.78,1:57:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.85,1:58:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.89,1:58:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.79,1:58:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.33,1:58:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.92,1:58:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.82,1:58:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一刻我以为你不管我了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.69,1:58:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一刻我确实想过
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.29,1:58:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一场游戏，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.50,1:58:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.34,1:58:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.11,1:59:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿吧，你救了我，去拿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.32,1:59:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一起拿，一，二… - 二…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.49,1:59:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三！ - 三！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.17,1:59:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 没事，你呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.18,1:59:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.22,1:59:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经来过这里
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.49,1:59:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个港口钥
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.86,1:59:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利，这个杯子是个港口钥 - 在梦里我来过这里
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.20,1:59:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞德里克，快回到火焰杯那里，快！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.77,1:59:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.98,2:00:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利，那是什么？ - 快回到火焰杯那里！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.52,2:00:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？你想怎样？ - 干掉多余的那个
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.02,2:00:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [咒语] - 不！塞德里克！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.10,2:00:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，现在就开始！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.92,2:00:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲的骨头…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.59,2:00:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…虽然不情愿地献出
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.36,2:01:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,奴婢的肉…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.43,2:01:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…高尚的奉献
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.71,2:01:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人的鲜血…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.25,2:01:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…贪婪地吸取
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.79,2:01:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔又一次复活了…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.53,2:01:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…又一次
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.86,2:02:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的魔杖，虫尾巴
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.81,2:02:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出你的手臂
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.94,2:02:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.71,2:02:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.52,2:02:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一只手臂，虫尾巴
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.62,2:03:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎，我的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.93,2:03:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经13年了…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.33,2:03:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…今天你们又重新聚集在我的面前 就好象是昨天发生的一样
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.77,2:03:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认我有点…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.17,2:03:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…失望
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.41,2:03:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有一个人试图来找寻我
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.68,2:04:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉普丝！格鲁穆！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.95,2:04:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥卢！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.79,2:04:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连你…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.29,2:04:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,…卢修斯
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.06,2:04:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人，只要我有您的踪迹 或者一丝丝的传言…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.07,2:04:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我的踪迹的，我圆滑的朋友 不仅仅是传言
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.24,2:04:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会证明给您看的，我的主人 我从来没有改换门庭
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.11,2:04:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在您不在的这期间 我在众人面前的所作所为…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.75,2:04:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…只不过是我完美的掩饰罢了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.75,2:04:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是愿意回到您的身边的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.79,2:04:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你害怕！不是忠心！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.83,2:04:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，这几个月的时间里 你至少表现出来还有点用，虫尾巴
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.81,2:05:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，主人
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.74,2:05:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.58,2:05:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好个帅小伙 - 别碰他！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.42,2:05:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.09,2:05:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点都忘记你还在这里了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.06,2:05:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在我父亲的尸骨上
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.63,2:05:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么介绍你呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.16,2:05:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这些时间以来 你都已经是和我齐名的人物了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.14,2:05:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大难不死的男孩
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.97,2:05:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的传奇中有多少谎言，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.04,2:05:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我提醒你13年前的那个晚上 到底发生了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.21,2:05:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我道出到底是什么 让我丧失了法力么？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.12,2:05:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，要我说吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.05,2:05:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为爱
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.56,2:05:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道么，当那可爱的莉莉·波特 为了她唯一的儿子…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.23,2:05:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…她给与了他终极的保护
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.23,2:06:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丝毫碰不到他
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.27,2:06:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个古老的魔法
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.57,2:06:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该预见到的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.00,2:06:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过没关系，没关系
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.97,2:06:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都改变了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.94,2:06:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以碰你了…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.05,2:06:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…现在
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.92,2:06:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.60,2:06:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,诧异你那几滴血 能给我带来那么大的转变吧，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.44,2:06:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起你的魔杖来，波特！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.77,2:06:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你拿起来！ 起来！起来！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.58,2:06:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该学过怎么决斗吧，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.08,2:06:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，我们要互相鞠躬
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.68,2:06:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，哈利 礼节是一定要遵守的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.22,2:06:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多可不想让你 忘记了自己的风度，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.62,2:06:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了，鞠躬
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.82,2:07:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在好多了，那么… - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.56,2:07:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.90,2:07:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.70,2:07:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.80,2:07:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母应该为你而感到骄傲
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.24,2:07:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你那个麻瓜母亲
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.81,2:07:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.42,2:07:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你，哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.98,2:07:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要毁了你
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.19,2:07:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了今晚，没人再能质疑我的力量
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.39,2:07:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了今晚 如果再有人提起你的话
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.13,2:07:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他们只可能谈起你是怎么…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.10,2:07:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…苦苦求死的
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.10,2:07:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是个仁慈的魔头…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.41,2:07:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…非常仁慈
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.34,2:07:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.85,2:07:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要背对着我躲起来，哈利·波特！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.98,2:08:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你看着我是怎么杀你的！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.42,2:08:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看到光明从你的眼眸中消失
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.57,2:08:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就满足你的要求
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.34,2:08:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [咒语] - [咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.26,2:08:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别插手，让我来结果他
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.50,2:08:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.27,2:09:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，当法术一旦切断的时候 你必须跑到到港口钥那里
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.44,2:09:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能为你赢得一点时间…
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.67,2:09:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不过就一点，明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.64,2:09:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，把我的身体带回去，好么？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.85,2:09:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的身体带到我父亲身边
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.42,2:09:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.22,2:09:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，准备好
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.02,2:09:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断！切断吧！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.40,2:09:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.47,2:10:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.22,2:10:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.06,2:10:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.49,2:10:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.20,2:10:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不，不要！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.73,2:10:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，邓不利多 发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.90,2:10:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来了，他回来了！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.64,2:10:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔复活了！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.84,2:10:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞德里克，他要求我 把他的身体带回来
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.41,2:10:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能把他留在那里
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.91,2:10:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了，哈利，没事了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.88,2:10:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回家了，你们两个都回家了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.35,2:10:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家都坐回原位！ 有个孩子被杀了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.06,2:10:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体必须被移走，邓布利多 这里有太多人了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.99,2:10:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我过去
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.86,2:10:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我过去！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.30,2:11:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我过去！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.73,2:11:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的孩子！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.44,2:11:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.71,2:11:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.25,2:11:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了，好了，不要太难过！ - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.98,2:11:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你不应该在这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.62,2:11:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.89,2:11:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了，有我在，有我在
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.46,2:11:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，冷静点
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.80,2:11:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.71,2:11:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.98,2:12:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好么，波特？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.25,2:12:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里还疼么？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.35,2:12:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在好多了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.09,2:12:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来帮你检查一下
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.33,2:12:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,奖杯是港口钥
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.03,2:12:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人给它施了魔法
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.14,2:12:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它什么样子的？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.57,2:12:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他长什么样子？ - 谁？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.41,2:12:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗魔头
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.48,2:12:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你站在他面前的时候 他什么样子？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.85,2:12:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.49,2:13:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好象一下子掉进了 我自己的一个梦里…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.39,2:13:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一个噩梦里
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.11,2:13:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其他人么？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.85,2:13:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其他人在墓地里吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.05,2:13:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.16,2:13:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像没有和你提过 关于墓地的事情吧，教授
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.53,2:13:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,“龙真是一种神奇的生物，不是吗？”
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.21,2:14:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有我的建议 那个傻蛋会把你带进森林么？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:00.45,2:14:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有我的提示？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.88,2:14:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为那个桃金娘会知道 要把金蛋放到水里吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.75,2:14:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是我先告诉他
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.86,2:14:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为纳威·隆巴顿 会找到呼吸草吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.69,2:14:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…如果不是我给了隆巴顿一本书 告诉他那里可以找到
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.06,2:14:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗！
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.04,2:14:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一开始就是你 是你把我的名字放在了火焰杯里
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.61,2:14:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你对克鲁姆施咒，但是你… - “但是，但是”
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.42,2:14:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢是因为我给你铺好了路
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.22,2:14:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你最终会出现在那个墓地里 因为那是你注定的
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.89,2:14:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在终于大功告成了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.86,2:14:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这些血管里流过的血 是黑暗魔头的血
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.71,2:15:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下他会怎么好好地奖赏我 当他得知…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.14,2:15:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我将会一劳永逸地…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.25,2:15:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…消灭了伟大的哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.75,2:15:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.72,2:15:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.46,2:15:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个，喝下去
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.93,2:15:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我是谁么？ - 阿不思·邓不利多
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.57,2:15:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是不是阿拉斯托·穆迪，是不是？ - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.44,2:15:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在不在这个屋子里面？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.58,2:15:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，到一边去！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.10,2:16:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好么，阿拉斯托？ - 我很抱歉，阿不思
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.40,2:16:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是穆迪，那么另一个是？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.27,2:16:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身水
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.54,2:16:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们知道是谁 偷了你储藏的药剂了，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.01,2:16:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就把你弄出来
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.38,2:16:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.45,2:16:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小巴蒂·克劳奇
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.89,2:17:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你展现给我看 我也展现给你看
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.19,2:17:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出你的手臂，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.77,2:17:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道这意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.90,2:17:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他复活了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.44,2:17:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔卷土重来了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.51,2:17:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，老师，我没能够阻止
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.04,2:17:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让猫头鹰给阿兹卡班送信 告诉他们逃脱了一个犯人
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.05,2:17:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我将会受到英雄般的礼遇 - 也许吧
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.12,2:17:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我个人对英雄不怎么感冒
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.88,2:17:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天，我们蒙受了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.25,2:17:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个无比巨大的损失
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.12,2:18:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都认识的塞德里克·迪戈里
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.05,2:18:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,生前极其勤奋刻苦
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.29,2:18:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,公正善良
Dialogue: 0,2:18:08.23,2:18:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.83,2:18:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个很热心的朋友
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.53,2:18:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们有权知道他是怎么死的
Dialogue: 0,2:18:23.94,2:18:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.31,2:18:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞德里克·迪戈里是被
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.31,2:18:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔头伏地魔杀害的
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.22,2:18:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法部不希望我告诉你们真相
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.42,2:18:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过如果我不告诉你们 我会觉得那是对他的一种侮辱
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.29,2:18:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种悲痛…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.13,2:18:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我们所共同感受到的 提醒了我
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.97,2:18:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒了大家
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.47,2:18:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么尽管我们来自不同地方 操着不同的口音
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.34,2:18:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们仍然万众一心
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.28,2:19:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过最近发生的事
Dialogue: 0,2:19:00.65,2:19:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个学期我们所建立起来的友谊 将比任何时候都重要
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.45,2:19:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好记住了 塞德里克·迪戈里不会白白牺牲的
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.22,2:19:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都好好记住了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.96,2:19:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要纪念这个男孩
Dialogue: 0,2:19:18.53,2:19:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个善良的、诚实的
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.50,2:19:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢的、真诚的男孩 直至他生命的终点
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.33,2:19:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来就不喜欢这些窗帘
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.96,2:19:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年级的时候，我曾经放火烧了它们
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.97,2:19:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然那是个意外啦
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.48,2:20:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉，今年我把你置于 很危险的处境里，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.25,2:20:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.15,2:20:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…当我在墓地的时候 有一个时刻…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.96,2:20:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…伏地魔的魔杖和我的 在某种程度上连接在一起的时候
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.93,2:20:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪回咒
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.40,2:20:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚你看到了你的父母，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.70,2:20:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们又出现了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.01,2:20:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有能够起死回生的魔咒的 你应该知道这点
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.35,2:20:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗和困难笼罩着前行的道路
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.42,2:20:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快我们就要在正确的 和轻松的之间进行选择
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.63,2:20:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过记住
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.46,2:20:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里，你有许多朋友
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.40,2:21:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.85,2:21:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.99,2:21:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你的
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.59,2:21:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,写信给我，答应我
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.90,2:21:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.54,2:21:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.42,2:22:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不能在霍格沃茨 普普通通过一年吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.12,2:22:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.42,2:22:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说 如果生活中没有龙会怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.19,2:22:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都要从现在开始改变了，是么？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.34,2:22:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.54,2:22:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我保证，这个夏天会给我写信 你们两个都要
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.01,2:22:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会的，你知道我不会的
Dialogue: 0,2:23:00.85,2:23:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利，你会写的，是吧？ - 没错，每周都写
